<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mateo Asɛmpa No</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mateo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Asɛmpa No</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kristo Mpanyimfo</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Yesu Kristo a ofi Ɔhene Dawid ne Abraham abusua mu no mpanyimfo din na edidi so yi:<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abraham ba ne Isak,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">Isak ba ne Yakob;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yakob nso mma ne Yuda ne ne nuanom.<verse eid="MAT 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuda mma ne Peres ne Sera. Wɔn na ne Tamar.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Peres ba ne Hesron</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">na Hesron nso ba ne Ram.<verse eid="MAT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Ram woo Aminadab,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadab woo Nahson,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Nahson nso woo Salmon.<verse eid="MAT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmon ne ne yere Rahab woo Boas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Boas ne ne yere Rut woo Obed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obed nso woo Yisai.<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yisai ba ne Ɔhene Dawid.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawid ba ne Salomo. Dawid ne Batseba a na anka ɔyɛ Uria yere no na wɔwoo Salomo.<verse eid="MAT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Salomo woo Rehoboam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehoboam woo Abia,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abia woo Asa.<verse eid="MAT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asa woo Yehosafat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehosafat woo Yoram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yoram nso woo Usia<verse eid="MAT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Usia ba ne Yotam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotam ba ne Ahas:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahas ba ne Hiskia.<verse eid="MAT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hiskia ba ne Manase,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase ba ne Amon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon nso ba ne Yosia.<verse eid="MAT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosia woo Yekonia ne ne nuanom. Wɔwoo wɔn bere a na Yudafo te nnommum mu wɔ Babilon no.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Wɔn a wofi Babilon nnommum mu bae no akyi awo ntoatoaso ni:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Yekonia woo Sealtiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Sealtiel woo Serubabel.<verse eid="MAT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Serubabel woo Abihud,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihud woo Eliakim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliakim nso woo Asor.<verse eid="MAT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Asor ba ne Sadok,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadok ba ne Akim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim ba ne Elihud.<verse eid="MAT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Elihud ba ne Eleasar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleasar ba ne Matan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Matan nso ba ne Yakob,<verse eid="MAT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakob woo Yosef a ɔwaree Maria no. Saa Maria yi na ɔwoo Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Awo ntoatoaso a efi Abraham so de besi Ɔhene Dawid so yɛ dunan. Efi Ɔhene Dawid so de besi bere a wɔfaa ɔman no nnommum kɔɔ Babilon no nso awo ntoatoaso yɛ dunan saa ara. Saa ara nso na efi bere a wotu fii Babilon san baa wɔn man mu bio no de besi Kristo awo so nso yɛ awo ntoatoaso dunan.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Sɛnea Yesu Kristo awo ho nsɛm te ni: Wɔde ne na Maria maa Yosef sɛ ɔnware no, nanso ansa na wobehyia mu sɛ awarefo no, ohuu sɛ wanyinsɛn; nea efi Honhom Kronkron. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Ɛbaa saa no, ne kunu Yosef a odi ne ho ni no ampɛ sɛ obegu Maria anim ase nti ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ obegyaa no aware wɔ kokoa mu.<verse eid="MAT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Bere a asɛm no ayɛ Yosef dadwen no, Awurade bɔfo beyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ no wɔ dae mu. Ɔbɔfo no kae se, “Yosef, Dawid ba, nsuro sɛ wobɛfa Maria sɛ wo yere efisɛ ne nyinsɛn no fi Honhom Kronkron. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Ɔbɛwo ɔbarima na woato no din Yesu, ase ne Agyenkwa, efisɛ ɔno na obegye ne nkurɔfo nkwa afi wɔn bɔne mu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Eyi nyinaa baa mu de hyɛɛ nea Awurade nam odiyifo no so kae no ma se: <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Ɔbabun no benyinsɛn, na wawo ɔbabarima, na wɔato no din Immanuel” a ase ne sɛ, “Onyankopɔn ne yɛn wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Bere a Yosef nyan no, ɔyɛɛ sɛnea ɔbɔfo no hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. Enti ɔkɔfaa Maria baa ne fi ma ɔbɛyɛɛ ne yere. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Nanso Yosef ne Maria anhyia da kosii sɛ Maria woo ɔbabarima maa Yosef too ne din “Yesu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Anyansafo A Wofi Apuei No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Bere a Ɔhene Herode di ade no na wɔwoo Yesu wɔ Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yudea. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Saa bere no ara mu na anyansafo bi fi apuei baa Yerusalem bebisae se, “Ɛhe na Yudafo hene a wɔawo no no wɔ? Yehuu ne nsoromma wɔ apuei nohɔ, nti na yɛaba sɛ yɛrebɛsom no.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Ɔhene Herode tee saa asɛm yi no, ɛhaw ɔne Yerusalemfo nyinaa adwene yiye. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Ɔhene Herode frɛɛ ɔman no mu asɔfo mpanyin ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo behyiae. Obisaa wɔn se, “Ɛhefa na wɔbɛwo Kristo no?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Wobuaa no se, “Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yudea. Na eyi ne nea odiyifo no kae:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“ ‘Ao kurow Betlehem, wo a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">woyɛ otitiriw wɔ Yudaman mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">wo mu na meyi nea obedi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">me man Israel anim ahwɛ wɔn so.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Ɔhene Herode frɛɛ anyansafo no kokoa mu bisaa wɔn bere pɔtee a wohuu nsoromma no. Ɔtoaa so ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>“Monkɔ Betlehem nkɔhwehwɛ abofra no. Sɛ muhu no a, mommɛka nkyerɛ me, na me nso menkɔsom no bi.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Anyansafo no tiee ɔhene no asɛm no wiei no, wɔkɔe. Wɔrekɔ no, nsoromma a wohuu wɔ apuei no san yii ne ho adi bio kyerɛɛ wɔn. Edii wɔn anim kosii faako a wɔawo abofra no wɔ Betlehem hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Bere a wohuu nsoromma no, wɔn ani gyee mmoroso. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Woduu ofi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anyansafo no ankɔhwɛ Yesu bere a ɔda mmoa adididaka mu sɛnea na amanne te ne sɛnea nguanhwɛfo no kɔhwɛɛ no no. Mmom, asram bi akyi no, wɔkɔhwɛɛ “abofra” no wɔ ne “fi.”</char></note> a abofra no ne ne na Maria wɔ mu no, wɔkotow sɔree no. Wɔde wɔn akyɛde a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ, aduhuam ne kurobow yɛɛ no ayɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Onyankopɔn soo wɔn dae bɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ se wɔnnsan nkɔ Herode nkyɛn bio wɔ Yerusalem. Enti wɔfaa ɔkwan foforo so kɔɔ wɔn kurom.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Wɔn Ho Aguaa Wɔ Misraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Anyansafo no kɔ akyi no, Awurade bɔfo soo Yosef dae se, “Sɔre fa abofra no ne ne na na monkɔ Misraim nkɔtena hɔ nkosi sɛ mɛkyerɛ mo bere a mobɛsan aba. Efisɛ Ɔhene Herode rehwehwɛ abofra no akum no.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Anadwo no ara Yosef faa abofra no ne Maria sii mu kɔɔ Misraim, <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>ma wɔtenaa hɔ kosii sɛ Ɔhene Herode wui. Eyi na ɛmaa nea Awurade nam odiyifo no so kae se, “Mafrɛ me Ba afi Misraim” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Betlehem Mmofra No Kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Herode huu sɛ anyansafo no adaadaa no no, ne bo fuw mmoroso. Ɔsomaa nʼasraafo se wɔnkɔ Betlehem ne nkurow a atwa ho ahyia no nyinaa mu nkokunkum nkokoaa mmarimaa kosi wɔn a wɔadi mfe abien so, sɛnea anyansafo no bere a wɔkae sɛ wɔwoo abofra no wɔ mu no kyerɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Nea wɔnam odiyifo Yeremia so kae no baa mu se,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Wɔte nne bi wɔ Rama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">Ɛyɛ osu ne agyaadwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahel resu ne mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">na ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔkyekye ne werɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">efisɛ wɔnte ase bio.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsan Ba Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herode wu akyi no, Awurade bɔfo yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ Yosef wɔ dae mu wɔ Misraim ka kyerɛɛ no se, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>“Sɔre na fa abofra no ne ne na kɔ Israel asase so, efisɛ wɔn a wɔpɛe sɛ wokum abofra no awuwu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Yosef faa abofra no ne ne na san kɔɔ Israel asase so bio. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Yosef tee sɛ Arkelao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔhempɔn Herode ba yi dii ade sɛ ɔhene wɔ Yudea ne Samaria mfirihyia du pɛ. (4 AYA–6 YAA) Na ɔyɛ otirimɔdenfo ne nhyɛsotraso. Eyi ma wotuu no ade so maa Yudea bɛyɛɛ Roma mantam a na wotua tow ma Roma Ɔhempɔn no ananmusini.</char></note> a ɔyɛ Herode ba na odi hene wɔ Yudea saa bere no mu no, osuroo sɛ ɔbɛkɔ hɔ. Awurade san soo no dae foforo bio sɛ ɔnnkɔ Yudea, na mmom, ɔnkɔ Galilea.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu bere so no, na Galilea da Ɔman Kronkron no atifi fam.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Enti wɔkɔtenaa kurow Nasaret mu. Eyi nso maa nea adiyifo no kae se, “Wɔbɛfrɛ no Nasareni” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Osuboni Yohane Asɛnka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Bere a Yesu ne nʼawofo wɔ Nasaret no, Osuboni Yohane bɛkaa asɛm wɔ Yudea sare so se, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>“Monsakra mo adwene; momfa mo ho mma Onyankopɔn na ɔsoro ahenni no abɛn” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Yohane ne nea odiyifo Yesaia kaa ne ho asɛm se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Obi nne reteɛ mu wɔ sare so se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mommɔ kwan mma Awurade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">momma nʼatempɔn nteɛ!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Saa bere no na Yohane fura yoma ho nwi ntama bɔ aboa nhoma abɔso. Na nʼaduan yɛ mmoadabi ne ɛwo. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Yerusalemfo ne Yudeafo ne nnipa a wɔte Asubɔnten Yordan ho no nyinaa kɔɔ ne nkyɛn wɔ sare no so hɔ kotiee asɛm no bi. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Wɔkaa wɔn bɔne ma ɔbɔɔ wɔn asu wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan mu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Yohane huu sɛ Farisifo ne Sadukifo pii reba ne nkyɛn ma wabɔ wɔn asu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Awɔ mma! Hena na ɔka kyerɛɛ mo se munguan mfi Onyankopɔn abufuw a ɛreba no ano? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Monkɔbɔ ɔbra pa mfa nkyerɛ sɛ moasakra ampa. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Na monnhoahoa mo ho sɛ moyɛ Abraham asefo, efisɛ Onyankopɔn betumi ama saa abo yi adan nnipa ma wɔabɛyɛ Abraham asefo. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Onyankopɔn de nʼabonnua ato dua biara a ɛnsow aba pa ntin so sɛ ɔde betwa na ɔde agu gya mu ahyew no.<verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>“Me de, mede nsu na ɛrebɔ wɔn a wɔasakra wɔn su no asu. Nanso nea odi mʼakyi reba no de, ɔso sen me a ne mpaboa mpo mensɛ sɛ mikura. Ɔno de, sɛ ɔba a, ɔde Honhom Kronkron ne ogya na ɛbɛbɔ mo asu. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Obehuhuw aburow no so ayiyi mu aba pa no afi ntɛtɛ no mu, na ɔde aba pa no akosie, na ɔde ogya a ennum da ahyew ntɛtɛ no pasaa.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asubɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Yesu tee Osuboni Yohane nka no, ofii Galilea baa Asubɔnten Yordan ho sɛ Yohane mmɔ no asu. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Yohane huu sɛ ɔmfata sɛ ɔbɔ Yesu asu nti ɔkae se, “Wo na ɛsɛ sɛ wobɔ me asu na ɛnyɛ me.”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Otwa ara na etwa sɛ wobɔ me asu sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a nea Onyankopɔn ahyɛ ato hɔ no bɛba mu.”</char> Yesu asɛm a ɔkae no nti, Yohane bɔɔ no asu.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Wɔbɔɔ Yesu asu wiei no, ofii asu no mu, na hwɛ, ɔsoro buei. Ohuu Onyankopɔn Honhom sɛ ɛresian ba ne so sɛ aborɔnoma. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Ɛhɔ ara, nne bi fi ɔsoro kae se, “Oyi ne me Dɔba a ɔsɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbonsam Sɔ Yesu Hwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Eyi akyi no, Honhom Kronkron faa Yesu kɔɔ sare so sɛ ɔbonsam nkɔsɔ no nhwɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Saa bere no mu, Yesu dii mmuada adaduanan; awia ne anadwo. Eyi maa ɔkɔm dee no. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Ɔbonsam baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba no a, ka na saa abo yi nnan aduan.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Wɔakyerɛw se, ‘Ɛnyɛ aduan nko ara na ɛho hia onipa wɔ nʼasetena mu, na mmom asɛm biara a efi Awurade anom.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Afei ɔbonsam de Yesu kɔɔ Yerusalem de no kogyinaa asɔredan a ɛwɔ hɔ no atifi pɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba no ampa ara a, huruw fi nea wugyina hɔ si fam, efisɛ, wɔakyerɛw se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“ ‘Onyankopɔn bɛsoma nʼabɔfo abeso wo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">wɔde wɔn nsa bɛma wo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">na wo nan ampem ɔbo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu buaa bio se, <char style="wj">“Wɔakyerɛw se, ‘Nsɔ Awurade wo Nyankopɔn nhwɛ.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Eyi akyi no, ɔbonsam de Yesu kɔɔ bepɔw tenten bi apampam. Ɔde nʼani kari kyerɛɛ no wiase ahenni ahorow ne mu anuonyam nyinaa. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Sɛ wobɛkotow asom me a, mede nea wuhu yi nyinaa bɛma wo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu buae se, <char style="wj">“Fi me so, Satan! Hu sɛ wɔakyerɛw se, ‘Kotow som Awurade, wo Nyankopɔn, na ɔno nko ara na som no.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Yesu ano sii no, ɔbonsam gyaw no hɔ kɔe. Ɛno akyi no abɔfo baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛsom no.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Fi Nʼadwuma Ase Wɔ Galilea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesu tee sɛ wɔakyere Yohane no, ɔkɔɔ Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Oduu Galilea no, wantena Nasaret, na mmom otwaa mu wɔ Nasaret hɔ kɔtenaa Kapernaum a ɛwɔ Galilea mpoano no, Sebulon ne Naftali ahye so. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Eyi maa nea Odiyifo Yesaia kae no baa mu sɛ,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Sebulon asase ne Naftali asase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">ɛpo kwan so, Yordan agya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilea a amanamanmufo te hɔ,<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>nnipa a wɔte sum mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">Hann kɛse bi apue ama wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Hann no apue ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">wɔn a wɔte owu asase so.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Efi saa bere no, Yesu fii nʼasɛnka ase se, <char style="wj">“Monsakra mo adwene, momfa mo ho mma Onyankopɔn na ɔsoro ahenni no abɛn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Asuafo Baanan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Da bi a Yesu nam Galilea mpoano no, ohuu anuanom baanu bi a wɔn nyinaa yɛ apopofo sɛ wɔregu asau wɔ po no mu. Saa anuanom yi mu baako din de Simon a ne din foforo nso de Petro. Ɔbaako no nso din de Andrea. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mummedi mʼakyi na mɛsoma mo ama moakoyi nnipa kra.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Ɛhɔ ara wogyaw wɔn asau no guu hɔ kodii nʼakyi ne no kɔe.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra no, ohuu Sebedeo mma baanu a wɔfrɛ ɔbaako Yohane na ɔbaako nso din de Yakobo sɛ wɔne wɔn agya te ɔkorow mu repempam wɔn asau mu. Yesu frɛɛ wɔn nso se wommedi nʼakyi. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Ntɛm ara, wogyaw wɔn agya ne ɔkorow no hɔ kodii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galilea Asɛnka Ne Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu kyinkyinii Galileaman mu nyinaa kaa ahenni no ho asɛmpa wɔ Yudafo hyiadan mu. Ɔsaa nyarewa ahorow a wɔde baa nʼanim nyinaa nso. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Yesu anwonwade a ɔyɛe yi trɛw koduu Siriaman mu nyinaa. Eyi ma wɔde wɔn a ahonhommɔne wɔ wɔn so, wɔn a wotwa, wɔn a wɔyare mmubui ne wɔn a nyarewa ahorow haw wɔn no nyinaa fi Siriaman mu brɛɛ no ma ɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yare. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Anwonwade a Yesu yɛɛ yi maa nnipakuw a wofi Galilea ne nkurow “Dekapoli” no mu ne Yerusalem ne Yordan agya tu dii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhyira Nsɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Ohuu nnipakuw no saa no, ɔkɔɔ bepɔw bi so. Ɔtenaa ase no, nʼasuafo no kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Na ofii ase kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn se,<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne wɔn a wonim sɛ wɔyɛ ahiafo wɔ honhom mu,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na ɔsoro ahenni yɛ wɔn dea.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔn werɛ ahow,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛkyekye wɔn werɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne ahobrɛasefo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛma wɔadi asase so.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔn pɛ ne sɛ wɔbɛyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛde,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛma wɔn nea ehia wɔn.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wohu mmɔbɔ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn behu wɔn mmɔbɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔn koma mu tew,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na wobehu Onyankopɔn.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne apatafo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Onyankopɔn bɛfrɛ wɔn ne mma.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne wɔn a esiane sɛ wɔyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛde nti, wɔtaa wɔn,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn na Ɔsoro Ahenni no yɛ wɔn dea.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne mo a me din mu nti, wɔyaw mo, taa mo, twa atoro, ka asɛmmɔne to mo so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/><char style="wj">Momma mo ani nnye na monsɛpɛw mo ho, efisɛ mowɔ akatua a ɛso wɔ ɔsoro. Munhu sɛ saa ara na wɔtaa adiyifo a wodii mo kan no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkyene Ne Kanea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mone asase yi so nkyene. Sɛ nkyene dɛ yera a, ɔkwan bɛn so na wɔbɛfa ama ayɛ nkyene bio? Enye mma hwee bio, gye sɛ wohwie gu na nnipa tiatia so.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mone wiase kanea. Kurow a ɛda bepɔw so no ntumi nhintaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/><char style="wj">Wɔnnsɔ kanea mfa nsie, na mmom wɔde si petee mu na ahyerɛn ama wɔn a wɔwɔ ofi no mu no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na momma mo nneyɛe pa nna adi mma nnipa nhu na wɔafa so ahyɛ mo Agya a ɔwɔ soro no anuonyam.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara No Mu Denhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnsusuw sɛ maba sɛ merebɛsɛe Mmara no anaa Adiyifo no nkyerɛkyerɛ no. Na mmom maba sɛ merebɛhyɛ no ma sɛnea ne nyinaa bɛba mu pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/><char style="wj">Munhu sɛ ɔsoro ne asase da so wɔ hɔ yi, Mmara no mu biribiara rensakra da kosi sɛ ne nyinaa bɛba mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/><char style="wj">Eyi nti, obiara a obebu mmara nsɛm no mu fa bi so na ɔbɛkyerɛkyerɛ afoforo ama wɔn nso abu mmara nsɛm no mu fa bi so no bɛyɛ akumaa ɔsoro ahenni mu. Na obiara a obedi mmara no so, na ɔbɛkyerɛkyerɛ afoforo ama wɔn nso adi mmara no so no bɛyɛ ɔkɛse Ɔsoro Ahenni mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/><char style="wj">Enti merebɔ mo kɔkɔ sɛ, sɛ mopɛ sɛ mokɔ ɔsoro ahenni mu de a, gye sɛ moyɛ Onyankopɔn apɛde sen nea Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no ne Farisifo no yɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abufuw Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka se, ‘Nea odi awu no, ɔno nso ɛsɛ sɛ wokum no bi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/><char style="wj">Na me de, nea mereka ne sɛ, obiara a ne bo befuw ne nua no, wobebu no atɛn. Bio, obiara a ɔbɛyeyaw ne nua no, wɔbɛfrɛ no wɔ mpanyin anim. Afei obiara a ɔbɛka akyerɛ ne nua se, ‘Ogyimifo’ no bɛkɔ amanehunu gya mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti sɛ ɛba sɛ worekɔbɔ afɔre na wokae sɛ wo ne wo nua wɔ asɛm a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/><char style="wj">gyae afɔre no bɔ, na kɔ na wo ne wo nua no nkɔbɔ mu ansa na woakɔbɔ wʼafɔre no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wo ne obi nya asɛm a, wo ne no mmɔ mu ntɛm, na wamfa wo ankɔ asennii ankɔma otemmufo, na otemmufo no amfa wo anhyɛ afiasehwɛfo nsa, na afiasehwɛfo no amfa wo ankɔto afiase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/><char style="wj">Mereka no nokware akyerɛ mo se, ansa na wubefi asennii hɔ no, gye sɛ woatua sika biara a wɔregye afi wo hɔ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aguamammɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka se, ‘Nsɛe aware.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/><char style="wj">Na me de, nea mereka ne sɛ: Obiara a ohu ɔbea na ne kɔn dɔ no ne koma mu no, abɔ aguaman.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wʼani baako a eye to wo hintidua a, eye sɛ wubetu atow akyene. Efisɛ eye sɛ wobɛhwere wʼakwaa fa bi sen sɛ wɔbɛtow wo nipadua no nyinaa akyene amanehunu gya mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ wo nsa a eye to wo hintidua a, eye sɛ wubetwa atow akyene. Efisɛ eye sɛ wobɛhwere wʼakwaa fa bi sen sɛ wɔbɛtow wo nipadua nyinaa akyene amanehunu gya mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awaregyae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka se, ‘Obiara a obegyaa ne yere no mma no awaregyae krataa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/><char style="wj">Na me de, nea mereka ne sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi gyaa ne yere a ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔbea no abɔ aguaman na ɔbea no san kɔware bio a, na ɔbarima a ogyaa no no ama ɔbea no asɛe aware. Ɔbarima foforo a ɔbɛware ɔbea no nso asɛe aware saa ara.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkasa Mu Nokwaredi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bio, Mose mmara no ka se, ‘Mmu bɔ a woahyɛ Onyankopɔn no so, na mmom di bɔ a woahyɛ no no so.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/><char style="wj">Na me de, nea mereka ne sɛ: Monnka ntam mmfa nhyɛ bɔ. Monnnɔ ɔsoro, efisɛ ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn ahengua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/><char style="wj">Monnnɔ fam, efisɛ ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn nan ase agua. Monnnɔ Yerusalem, efisɛ ɛyɛ ɔhenkɛse kuropɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/><char style="wj">Mfa wo ti nka ntam, efisɛ worentumi nnan tinwi baako mpo mma ɛnyɛ fitaa anaa tuntum.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/><char style="wj">Momma mo nsɛm nyɛ ‘Yiw’ anaa ‘Dabi.’ Asɛm biara a wobɛka a ɛnyɛ Yiw anaa dabi no fi ɔbonsam.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aweretɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mose mmara no ka se, ‘Sɛ obi tu wʼani a, tu ne de bi. Sɛ obi tu wo se nso a, tu ne de bi.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/><char style="wj">Na me de, nea mereka ne se: Mommfa bɔne ntua bɔne so ka! Sɛ obi bɔ wʼaso nifa mu a, dan benkum no nso ma no na ɔmmɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi ne wo di asɛm gye wʼatade nhyɛase a, worɔw wʼatade nguguso ka ho ma no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi hyɛ wo sɛ, wo ne no nnantew ɔkwansin baako a, wo ne no nkɔ akwansin abien.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi srɛ wo biribi a, fa ma no; obi pɛ sɛ ɔfɛm wo hɔ biribi a, fa fɛm no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dɔ Wʼatamfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Moate sɛ wɔaka se, ‘Dɔ wo yɔnko na tan wo tamfo.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/><char style="wj">Na me de, nea mereka ne sɛ: monnɔ mo atamfo na mommɔ mpae mma wɔn a wɔhaw mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/><char style="wj">Eyi bɛma moayɛ mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no mma, efisɛ ɔma ne owia pue, ma ne osu tɔ ma nnipa bɔne ne nnipa pa nyinaa pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/><char style="wj">Sɛ modɔ wɔn a wɔdɔ mo no nko ara a, akatua bɛn na mubenya? Ɛnyɛ saa ara na nnebɔneyɛfo nso yɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mukyia wɔn a munim wɔn nko ara a, nsonoe bɛn na ɛda mo ne afoforo ntam? Ɛnyɛ saa ara na nnebɔneyɛfo nso yɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/><char style="wj">Enti monyɛ pɛ sɛnea mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no yɛ pɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyaatwom Papayɛ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yiye na moanyɛ papa ankyerɛ nnipa amfa ampɛ anuonyam. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, morennya mfaso biara mfi mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ woyɛ papa a mmɔ no dawuru sɛnea nyaatwomfo yɛ wɔ asɔredan mu ne mmɔnten so no. Merema mo ate sɛ saa nnipa no anya wɔn akatua dedaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woyɛ papa a, mma obiara nhu, mpo sɛ wode wo nsa nifa yɛ papa a, mma wo nsa benkum nhu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/><char style="wj">na wʼagya a onim kokoa mu nsɛm nyinaa no betua wo ka.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaatwom Mpaebɔ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ morebɔ mpae a, mommmɔ mpae sɛnea nyaatwomfo gyina asɔredan mu ne mmɔnten so bɔ mpae de pɛ nnipa anim anuonyam no. Merema moate ase sɛ, saa nnipa no anya wɔn akatua dedaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wobɔ mpae a, hyɛn wo dan mu, na to wo pon mu, na bɔ wʼAgya a wonhu no no mpae, na wʼAgya a onim kokoa mu nsɛm no betua wo ka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mobɔ mpae a, monnkasakasa bebree, nti nsɛm mu nsusuw sɛ, sɛ moyɛ saa a na Onyankopɔn betie mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/><char style="wj">Mo Agya Nyankopɔn nim nea ehia mo nyinaa ansa na mubisa no.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti saa ɔkwan yi so na momfa mmɔ mpae:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Yɛn Agya a wowɔ ɔsoro,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">
    <char style="wj">wo din ho ntew.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>
    <char style="wj">Wʼahenni mmra.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">
    <char style="wj">Nea wopɛ nyɛ wɔ asase so,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">
    <char style="wj">sɛnea ɛyɛ wɔ ɔsoro.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Ma yɛn, yɛn daa aduan nnɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>
    <char style="wj">na fa yɛn aka kyɛ yɛn,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">
    <char style="wj">sɛnea yɛde kyɛ wɔn a wɔde yɛn aka.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Nnyaa yɛn nkɔ sɔhwɛ mu.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <char style="wj">Na yi yɛn fi ɔbɔnefo no nsam.’</char><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Sɛ mode wɔn a wɔfom mo mfomso kyɛ wɔn a, mo nso mo ɔsoro Agya no de mo mfomso bɛkyɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/><char style="wj">Nanso sɛ moamfa wɔn a wɔfom mo mfomso ankyɛ wɔn a, mo ɔsoro Agya no nso remfa mo mfomso nkyɛ mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaatwom Mmuadadi Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ mudi mmuada a, monnyɛ mo anim mmɔbɔmmɔbɔ sɛnea nyaatwomfo di mmuada a wɔyɛ de pɛ nnipa anim anuonyam no. Merema mo ate ase sɛ, saa nnipa no anya wɔn akatua dedaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wudi mmuada a, serɛn wo ti, na hohoro wʼanim, na ma wʼanim nyɛ frɔmfrɔm,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/><char style="wj">na mma nnipa nhu sɛ woredi mmuada, gye wʼAgya a ohu nea woyɛ wɔ kokoa mu nyinaa no nko ara; na wʼAgya a onim kokoa mu nsɛm nyinaa no betua wo ka.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnhyehyɛ mo agyapade wɔ asase yi so, nea ntɛferɛw betumi awe, na ebetumi agye nkannare na asɛe, na akorɔmfo betumi awia.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/><char style="wj">Mmom monhyehyɛ mo agyapade wɔ ɔsoro, nea ntɛferɛw ntumi nwe, na entumi nnye nkannare nsɛe, na akorɔmfo ntumi nwia.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/><char style="wj">Na nea wʼagyapade wɔ no, ɛhɔ na wo koma nso wɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wʼani yɛ wo nipadua kanea. Ɛno nti sɛ wʼani ye a, na wo nipadua nyinaa yɛ hann.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/><char style="wj">Nanso sɛ wʼaniwa nye a, ɛma wo nipadua no nyinaa dan sum tumm. Enti sɛ hann a ɛwɔ wo mu no yɛ sum a, na wo nipadua no yɛ sum kabii.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara ntumi nsom awuranom baanu, efisɛ ɔyɛ saa a, ɔbɛdɔ ɔbaako na watan ɔbaako anaasɛ, ɔbɛsom ɔbaako yiye na wabu ɔbaako animtiaa. Morentumi nsom Onyankopɔn ne ahonyade.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Eyi nti na mitu mo fo se, munnnwinnwen nea mubedi anaa nea mobɛnom anaa nea mubefura ho. Mowɔ ɔkra ne nipadua a ɛsom bo sen nea mubedi ne nea mubefura.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ wim nnomaa, wonnua aba na wontwa aba mmoaboa ano mfa nsie, nanso mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no ma wɔn aduan di. Monnsom bo nsen wɔn ana?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/><char style="wj">Mo mu hena na ɔdwene a adwennwene no betumi ato ne nkwa nna so simmasin mpo?</char><verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na mudwinnwen ntama ho? Monhwɛ afifide bi sɛ wuram nhwiren, wɔnnwene ntama ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/><char style="wj">Nanso Salomo ahonya ne nʼanuonyam nyinaa akyi no, na nʼahoɔfɛ nnu wuram nhwiren yi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ Onyankopɔn tumi fura afifide a ɛwɔ hɔ nnɛ na ɔkyena enni hɔ ntama a, mo a mo gyidi sua, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔrentumi mma mo nea ehia mo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/><char style="wj">Enti munnnwinnwen nea mubedi, nea mobɛnom anaasɛ nea mubefura ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wonni gyidi no na bere biara wodwen saa nneɛma no ho. Na mo de, mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nim sɛ eyinom nyinaa ho hia mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/><char style="wj">Enti monhwehwɛ Onyankopɔn Ahenni ne ne trenee kan, na ɔde nea ehia mo nyinaa bɛka mo ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/><char style="wj">Enti munnnwinnwen ɔkyena ho. Onyankopɔn no ara de nea ehia mo no bɛma mo. Ɛda biara ne mu nsɛm.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Atɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mummmu ntɛn, na afoforo ammu mo ntɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/><char style="wj">Nea mode yɛ afoforo no, ɛno ara na wɔde bɛyɛ mo.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn na woma dua ntɛtɛ a ɛda wo nua ani so no haw wo, bere a mpuran a ɛda wo de so no mfa wo ho?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/><char style="wj">Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na woatumi aka akyerɛ wo nua se, ‘Ma minyi ntɛtɛ a ɛda wʼani so no mma wo,’ bere a mpuran da wʼani so daa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/><char style="wj">Nyaatwomni! Di kan yi mpuran a ɛda wʼankasa ani so no ansa na woatumi ahu ntɛtɛ a ɛda wo nua ani so no yiye na woayi ama no.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommfa nea ɛho tew mma akraman. Saa ara nso na monntow mo nhene pa ngu mprako anim! Wobetiatia so, na wɔadan wɔn ho atow ahyɛ mo so.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisa, Hwehwɛ, Pem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mummisa, na wɔbɛma mo; monhwehwɛ, na mubehu; mompem, na wobebue mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a obisa no, onya. Obiara a ɔhwehwɛ no, ohu; na nea ɔpem no, wobue no.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na hena na ne ba bisa no brodo a ɔbɛma no ɔbo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/><char style="wj">Anaasɛ obisa no nsumnam a ɔbɛma no ɔwɔ? Ɛremma saa da!</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mo a moyɛ abɔnefo mpo nim sɛnea moma mo mma nnepa a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no mfa nnepa mma ne mma wɔn a wobisa no no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/><char style="wj">Enti sɛnea mmara no ne adiyifo no ka no, ade biara a mopɛ sɛ nnipa nyɛ mma mo no, mo nso monyɛ mma wɔn saa ara.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpon Ne Ɔkwan Hiahiaa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔkwan teateaa no nko ara so na wubetumi afa akɔ ɔsoro! Ɔkwan a ɛkɔ ɔbonsam kurom no trɛw, na nʼapon nso mu bae ma nnipadɔm a wɔfa so kɔ ɔsɛe mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/><char style="wj">Ɔpon a wowura mu de kɔ nkwa mu no yɛ hiahiaa na ɔkwan a wɔfa so no nso yɛ teateaa, na nnipa kakraa bi na wohu fa so.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho yiye wɔ atoro akyerɛkyerɛfo a wɔba mo nkyɛn ahobrɛase mu sɛ nguan, nanso wɔyɛ mpataku a wonya mo a, wɔbɛtetew mo pasaa no ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/><char style="wj">Wɔn nneyɛe na mode behu wɔn, sɛnea mutumi de dua bi aba hu dua ko a ɛyɛ no. Worentumi ntew bobe wɔ nsɔe so; saa ara nso na worentumi ntew borɔdɔma wɔ nnɛnkyɛnse so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/><char style="wj">Dua a ɛwɔ nnyinaso pa no tumi sow aba pa; na dua a enni nnyinaso pa no nso sow aba bɔne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/><char style="wj">Dua pa ntumi nsow aba bɔne; saa ara nso na dua bɔne ntumi nsow aba pa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/><char style="wj">Dua biara a ɛnsow aba pa no, wotwa de gu gya mu hyew no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/><char style="wj">Onipa nneyɛe na ɛma wohu ne suban.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ obiara a ɔbɔ me din ‘Awurade, Awurade’ no na ɔbɛkɔ ɔsoro ahemman mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/><char style="wj">Atemmu da no, nnipa pii bɛka akyerɛ me se, ‘Awurade, yɛkaa wo ho asɛm kyerɛɛ afoforo. Yɛnam wo din nso so tuu ahonhommɔne, san yɛɛ anwonwade, ahorow.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/><char style="wj">Na mabua wɔn se, ‘Minnim mo da. Mumfi me so nkɔ, nnebɔneyɛfo!’</char><verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔn a wotie nea meka, na wodi so no te sɛ onyansafo a osi ne dan si ɔbotan so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/><char style="wj">Osu tɔe, na osuframa bɔe, na nsu yirii, na emu biara kaa ɔdan no nanso ammu da, efisɛ wosi sii ɔbotan so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/><char style="wj">Nanso wɔn a wotie nea meka na wonni so no te sɛ ɔkwasea bi a osii ne dan sii nwea so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/><char style="wj">Osu tɔe, na osuframa bɔe, na nsu yirii, na emu biara kaa ɔdan no. Na edwiriw guu fam, bubuu pasaa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu asɛnka no maa nnipadɔm a wotiee no no nyinaa ho dwiriw wɔn, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>efisɛ ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ te sɛ obi a okura tumi, na ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no nte sɛ nea Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo no kyerɛ no.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Bere a Yesu sian bepɔw no, dɔm dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Ɔkwatani bi baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛkotow no srɛɛ no se, “Me wura, mesrɛ wo, sɛ ɛyɛ wo pɛ a, sa me yare.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu teɛɛ ne nsa de kaa ɔkwatani no kae se, <char style="wj">“Mɛsa wo yare. Wo ho mfi!”</char> Amono mu hɔ ara, kwata no fii ne ho. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Wo ne obiara nni wʼayaresa yi ho nkɔmmɔ. Kɔ na fa wo ho kɔkyerɛ ɔsɔfo, na bɔ afɔre a Mose hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmmɔ sɛ adansede no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu kɔɔ Kapernaum. Oduu hɔ no, Roma asraafo ɔha so panyin bi baa ne kyɛn bebuu no nkotodwe kae se, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>“Awurade, mʼabofra abubu gu hɔ a ɔrehu amane; mesrɛ wo, bɛsa no yare ma me.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Mɛba abɛsa no yare.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Asraafo ha so panyin no tee Yesu asɛm a ɔkae no, ɔkae se, “Awurade, memfata sɛ woba me fi. Ka biribi na mʼabofra no ho bɛyɛ no den. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Meyɛ obi a mehyɛ tumi ase, na mesan wɔ asraafo a wɔhyɛ mʼase. Meka kyerɛ wɔn mu bi sɛ ɔnkɔ a, ɔkɔ. Meka kyerɛ ɔfoforo se ɔmmra a, ɔba. Saa ara nso na mehyɛ me somfo sɛ ɔnyɛ biribi a, ɔyɛ ara ne no.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu tee saa asɛm no, ɛyɛɛ no nwonwa. Ɔdan nʼani, ka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm a wodi nʼakyi no se, <char style="wj">“Israelman mu nyinaa, minhuu gyidi a ɛte sɛɛ da.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/><char style="wj">Na mereka akyerɛ mo se, nnipa pii befi apuei ne atɔe aba na wɔne Abraham, Isak ne Yakob abɛtena ase wɔ ɔsoro Ahenni no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/><char style="wj">Na Israelfo a wosiesiee ɔsoro ahenni maa wɔn no mu pii wɔ hɔ a wɔde wɔn nsa begu wɔn ti atwa agyaadwo na wɔatow wɔn agu sum kabii mu ama ɔyaw.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ asraafo so panyin no se, <char style="wj">“Kɔ fie. Nea wugye di no mmra mu saa mma wo!”</char> Abofra no ho tɔɔ no saa bere no ara mu!<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Petro Ase Yare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesu kɔɔ Petro fi. Ɔkɔtoo sɛ atiridii akyere Petro asebea ma ɔda hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Yesu soo ne nsa mu maa atiridii no tu fii no so. Ɔsɔre noaa aduan maa wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Saa da no anwummere no, wɔde wɔn a wɔwɔ ahonhommɔne pii brɛɛ Yesu. Nʼanom asɛm a ɔkae no maa ahonhommɔne no nyinaa tu yerae, na wɔn a wɔyare no nyinaa nso ho tɔɔ wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Eyi maa nea Odiyifo Yesaia kae se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Ɔfaa yɛn ahoɔmmerɛw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">na ɔsoaa yɛn nyarewa nyinaa” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesu huu sɛ dɔm no redɔɔso no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, wontwa ɔtare no nkɔ nʼagya nohɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Ɛhɔ ara Yudani kyerɛkyerɛfo bi ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, medi wʼakyi!”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Sakraman wɔ wɔn abon, wim nnomaa nso wɔ mmerebuw, nanso me, Onipa Ba no de, minni baabi a mede me ti to!”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Asuafo no mu baako bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Owura, ma me kwan na minkosie mʼagya ansa na mabedi wʼakyi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Nanso Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Di mʼakyi. Wɔn a wɔawu no nsie wɔn awufo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Brɛ Ahum Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesu saa nyarewa no wiee no, ɔkɔtenaa ɔkorow mu na nʼasuafo no dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Prɛko pɛ, ahum kɛse bi tu maa asorɔkye bu bɛkataa ɔkorow no so. Nanso na Yesu de, wada. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Nʼasuafo no de nteɛteɛmu kɔɔ ne nkyɛn, konyan no kae se, “Awurade! Gye yɛn na yɛreyɛ amem!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesu nyanee no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo a mo gyidi sua, adɛn na moabɔ hu saa?”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, ɔsɔre teɛteɛɛ ahum ne asorɔkye no ma ɛyɛɛ dinn.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Asuafo no ho dwiriw wɔn yiye. Wobisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho se, “Onipa bɛn mpo ni a ahum ne ɛpo tie no yi?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tu Ahohommɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no duu asuogya wɔ Gadarafo asase so no, nnipa baanu bi a ahonhommɔne wɔ wɔn so fii amusiei behyiaa no. Esiane sɛ na saa nnipa yi yɛ keka nti, na obiara ntumi mfa faako a wɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Wohuu no pɛ, wofii ase teɛteɛɛ mu se, “Onyankopɔn Ba, dɛn na worehwehwɛ afi yɛn nkyɛn? Woaba ha sɛ worebɛyɛ yɛn ayayade wɔ bere a mmere no nsoe ana?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Saa bere koro no ara mu, na mprakokuw bi redidi wɔ nkyɛn baabi. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Ahonhommɔne no srɛɛ Yesu se, “Sɛ wutu yɛn a, fa yɛn kɔhyɛ mprakokuw yi mu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesu teɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mumfi!”</char> Ɛhɔ ara ahonhommɔne no fii nnipa no mu, kowuraa mprako no mu. Mprakokuw no nyinaa de mmirika sian bepɔw no, koguu ɛpo no mu ma ɛfaa wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Ntɛm ara, wɔn a wɔhwɛ mprako no so no tuu mmirika kɔɔ kurom, kɔkaa nea asi no kyerɛɛ nkurɔfo. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Kurom hɔfo no tee nea aba no, wɔbɔɔ twi kɔɔ nea Yesu wɔ hɔ no. Wohuu Yesu no, wɔsrɛɛ no sɛ omfi wɔn man mu hɔ nkɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu De Obubuafo Bi Bɔne Kyɛ No Sa No Yare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Eyi akyi no, Yesu kɔtenaa ɔkorow bi mu kɔɔ Kapernaum, kurow a ɔte mu no mu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Oduu hɔ no, ankyɛ biara na nnipa bi de obubuafo bi brɛɛ no sɛ ɔnsa no yare. Na Yesu huu gyidi a wɔwɔ wɔ ne mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ obubuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Ɔba, ma wʼani nnye, wɔde wo bɔne nyinaa akyɛ wo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Ɛhɔ ara na Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo a na wɔwɔ hɔ no bi teɛɛ mu se, “Ɔbarima yi ka abususɛm. Ɔkyerɛ sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu huu nea ɛwɔ wɔn adwene mu no, obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na modwene bɔne wɔ mo koma mu saa?</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/><char style="wj">Me Onipa Ba no, mewɔ tumi wɔ asase yi so sɛ mede bɔne kyɛ. Nea ɛwɔ he na ɛyɛ den, sɛ obi bɛka se, ‘Mede wo bɔne akyɛ wo’ anaasɛ ɔbɛka se, ‘Sɔre na nantew?’ ”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Nanso sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ na mubehu sɛ Onipa Ba no wɔ tumi sɛ ɔde bɔne kyɛ nti. Ɔka kyerɛɛ obubuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Sɔre na bobɔw wo kɛtɛ, na kɔ fie efisɛ masa wo yare.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Amono mu hɔ ara, obubuafo no sɔre bobɔw ne kɛtɛ, sii mu kɔɔ ne fi! <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Nnipadɔm no huu anwonwade yi no, wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn yiye. Wɔkamfoo Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔde tumi a ɛte saa ama onipa.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Mateo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu fi nea ɔsaa obubuafo no yare hɔ rekɔ no, ohuu ɔbarima towgyeni bi a ɔte atowgyei. Wɔfrɛ saa ɔbarima no Mateo. Yesu huu no no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Bedi mʼakyi.”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, Mateo sɔre dii Yesu akyi.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Ɛbae sɛ Yesu ne nʼasuafo no kɔɔ Mateo fi kodidii. Wɔredidi no, towgyefo ne nnebɔneyɛfo bebree baa hɔ ne no ne nʼasuafo no too nsa didii. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Farisifo no huu sɛ ɔne nnebɔneyɛfo ato nsa redidi no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ. Wobisaa nʼasuafo no se, “Adɛn nti na mo kyerɛkyerɛfo no de ne ho abɔ nnebɔneyɛfo a wɔte sɛɛ yi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesu tee no, obuaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Nnipa a wɔnyare no, ɔyaresafo ho nhia wɔn, na nnipa a wɔyare no na ɔyaresafo ho hia wɔn.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Ɔsan kaa bio se, <char style="wj">“Monkɔhwehwɛ eyi ase wɔ Kyerɛw Kronkron no mu. Wɔakyerɛw se, ‘Ɛnyɛ mo afɔre ne ayɛyɛde na mepɛ, na mmom ahummɔbɔ.’ Mammɛfrɛ atreneefo, na mmom, mebɛfrɛɛ nnebɔneyɛfo sɛ wɔnsakra mmra Onyankopɔn nkyɛn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmuadadi Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Da bi Osuboni Yohane asuafo baa Yesu nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na wʼasuafo no nni mmuada, sɛnea yɛne Farisifo di mmuada no?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mugye di sɛ, sɛ ayeforokunu ne ne nnamfonom te hɔ a, ɛsɛ sɛ ne nnamfonom no werɛ how, na wobua da ana? Bere bi bɛba a wɔbɛfa me afi wɔn nkyɛn. Saa bere no na wobedi mmuada.</char><verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hena na ɔde ntama foforo bɛtare ntama dedaw mu? Saa ntaremu no besunsuan dedaw no mu ama tokuru kɛse abɛda hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/><char style="wj">Hena na ɔde nsa foforo begu aboa nhoma nsa nkotoku dedaw mu? Sɛ ɔyɛ saa a, nsa no bɛpae nkotoku no ama nsa no ahwie agu, na nkotoku no nso asɛe. Nsa nkotoku foforo</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tete no, na wɔde nsa gu mmirekyi ho nhoma nkotoku mu. Sɛ bobesa no buw a, ɛhoman ma mmoa ho nhoma kotoku no nso homan. Nanso kotoku dedaw a wɔde adi dwuma dedaw ma ahoman no, sɛ wɔde nsa foforo gu mu a, ɛbɛpae. Yesu gyina hɔ ma nneɛma foforo bi a ɛne nhyehyɛe dedaw no bɔ abira.</char></note> <char style="wj">mu nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsa foforo gugu na amma nkotoku no ne nsa no mu biara ansɛe.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbea Bi Ayaresa Ne Ababaa Bi Wunyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesu gu so rekasa no, Yudafo panyin bi ba bɛkotow, sɔree no. Ɔde nʼadesrɛ too Yesu anim se, “Me babea awu mprempren ara. Minim sɛ, sɛ woba de wo nsa bɛka no pɛ a, obenyan.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo no ne ɔpanyin no sii mu sɛ wɔrekɔ ɔpanyin no fi.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Wɔrekɔ no, ɔbea bi a mogya atu no mfirihyia dumien faa nʼakyi, soo nʼatade ano. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Ɔkaa wɔ ne tirim se, “Sɛ mede me nsa ka no nko ara a, me ho bɛyɛ me den.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu dan nʼani ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Ɔbabea, ma wo bo ntɔ wo yam. Wo gyidi agye wo. Wo ho atɔ wo.”</char> Efi saa bere no mu no, ne ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesu duu ɔpanyin no fi hɔ a ohuu sɛ nkurɔfo no bi resu na ebinom reto ayiase nnwom no, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>ɔkae se, <char style="wj">“Obiara mfi adi. Ababaa no nwui. Wada!”</char> Yesu asɛm a ɔkae yi maa nnipa no serew no. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Nnipa no nyinaa fii adi no, Yesu kɔɔ faako a ababaa no da hɔ no. Osoo ne nsa. Prɛko pɛ, ababaa no nyanee. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Saa anwonwade a Yesu yɛe yi trɛw wɔ mpɔtam hɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anifuraefo Baanu Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesu fi nea onyan ababaa no hɔ rekɔ no, anifuraefo baanu bi dii nʼakyi teɛteɛɛ mu se, “Dawid ba, hu yɛn mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesu duu fie no, anifuraefo no baa ne nkyɛn. Yesu bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mugye di sɛ metumi ama moahu ade?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Wobuaa no se, “Yiw, Awurade, yegye di!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Yesu de ne nsa kaa wɔn ani kae se, <char style="wj">“Mo gyidi nyɛ nea mohwehwɛ mma mo!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Amono mu hɔ ara na wɔn ani buebuei. Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano se, <char style="wj">“Monnka saa ayaresa yi ho asɛm nkyerɛ obiara.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Nanso nnipa no fii hɔ pɛ na wɔbɔɔ asɛm no dawuru.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mum Nifuraefo Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo refi adi no, wɔde mum bi a honhommɔne wɔ ne so brɛɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Yesu tuu honhommɔne no na prɛko pɛ, mum no kasae. Saa honhommɔnetu yi yɛɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa nwonwa ma wɔkae se, “Yenhuu saa anwonwade yi bi da wɔ Israelman mu ha!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Farisifo no de, wɔkae se, “Ɔbonsam de honhommɔne ahyɛ no ma nti na otumi tu ahonhommɔne no.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adwumayɛfo No Sua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu kyinkyinii nkurow so ne nkuraa ase kaa Onyankopɔn Ahenni no ho asɛmpa wɔ wɔn hyiadan mu. Baabiara a ɔkɔe no, ɔkaa asɛmpa no saa nyarewa ahorow bebree. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Bere a Yesu huu nnipadɔm no, ne yam hyehyee no maa wɔn efisɛ ohuu sɛ ɔhaw ahorow gu wɔn so a, wonhu nea wɔnyɛ ne nea wɔmfa a wobenya mmoa nso. Wɔte sɛ nguan a wonni ɔhwɛfo. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Ɛha na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Otwa adwuma no dɔɔso, nanso adwumayɛfo no sua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/><char style="wj">Enti monsrɛ adwumawura no na ɔmma adwumayɛfo bebree mmra ne twa adwuma no mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Soma Asuafo Dumien No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafo dumien no baa ne nkyɛn, na ɔmaa wɔn tumi sɛ wontu ahonhommɔne na wɔnsa nyarewa ne ahoɔmmerɛw nyinaa.<verse eid="MAT 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Yesu asuafo dumien no din ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 10:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">Simon a ne din baako ne Petro ne ne nua Andrea;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">Yakobo ne ne nua Yohane a wɔyɛ Sebedeo mma no,<verse eid="MAT 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filipo ne Bartolomeo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">Toma ne towgyefo Mateo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">Yakobo, Alfeo ba ne Tadeo,<verse eid="MAT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simon a ofi Kana ne Yuda Iskariot a akyiri no, oyii Yesu mae no.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesu somaa asuafo dumien no hyɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monnkɔ nea amanamanmufo wɔ anaa Samariafo kurow biara mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/><char style="wj">na mmom monkɔ Onyankopɔn nguan a wɔwɔ Israel a wɔayera no nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/><char style="wj">Monkɔka nkyerɛ wɔn se, ‘Onyankopɔn Ahenni no abɛn!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/><char style="wj">Monsa ayarefo yare, munnyan awufo, momma akwatafo ho mfi, na muntu ahonhommɔne. Sɛnea munyaa no kwa no, saa ara na mo nso na momfa mma kwa.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommmfa sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ anaa kɔbere biara mmɔ mo ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/><char style="wj">Mommmfa akwantukotoku anaa ntade anaa mpaboa anaa pema. Ɛsɛ sɛ odwumayɛni didi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/><char style="wj">Kurow biara a mobɛkɔ mu anaa akuraa biara a mobɛkɔ ase no, monhwehwɛ onipa a onyamesuro wɔ ne mu akyi kwan na montena ne nkyɛn kosi da a mubefi hɔ akɔ baabi foforo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mokɔ ofi bi mu a, munkyia wɔn se, ‘Asomdwoe nka mo!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/><char style="wj">Sɛ saa ofi no mufo gye mo fɛw so a, munhyira wɔn, na sɛ wɔannye mo de a, momfa mo asomdwoe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛ morefi ofi anaa kurow biara a wɔannye mo wɔ mu no mu akɔ a, momporoporow ofi no anaa kurow no mu mfutuma a ɛwɔ mo nan ase no ngu hɔ.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyi yɛ nea Farisifo yɛ bere a wofi baabiara a wobu sɛ amanamanmufo atena hɔ nti ɛhɔ agu fi no. Ɛyɛ kɔkɔbɔ a emu yɛ den ma wɔn a wɔpo Awurade asɛm no.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/><char style="wj">Nokware ni, atemmuda no, Sodom ne Gomora mpo benya baabi agyina wɔ Onyankopɔn anim sen saa kurow no.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monkae sɛ meresoma mo sɛ nguan akɔ mpataku mu. Monyɛ anifere sɛ awɔ na munnwo sɛ mmorɔnoma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/><char style="wj">Nanso monhwɛ yiye wɔ nnipa ho! Wɔbɛkyere mo adi mo asɛm, abɔ mo mmaa wɔ wɔn asɔredan mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/><char style="wj">Me nti, wɔde mo bɛkɔ atumfo ne ahene anim. Eyi bɛma moanya kwan aka asɛmpa no akyerɛ wɔn ne amanamanmufo no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔkyere mo a, munnnwinwen asɛm a mobɛka de ayi mo ho ano ho. Wɔde asɛm a mobɛka no bɛma mo bere a ɛsɛ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a mobɛka no remfi mo, na mmom, mo ɔsoro Agya no honhom na ɔnam mo so bɛkasa.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Onua beyi onua ama na wɔakum no. Saa ara na agyanom nso beyi wɔn mma ama. Mma bɛsɔre atia wɔn awofo ama wɔakum wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/><char style="wj">Me nti, nnipa nyinaa bɛtan mo. Nanso nea obetumi agyina pintinn akosi awiei no na wobegye no nkwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wɔtaa mo kurow baako mu a, munguan nkɔ kurow foforo mu. Mereka nokware akyerɛ mo se morenwie Israel nkurow nyinaa mu adwumayɛ ansa na Onipa Ba no aba.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Osuani nsen ne kyerɛkyerɛfo, na akoa nso nsen ne wura.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/><char style="wj">Osuani sua ne kyerɛkyerɛfo, na akoa nso sua ne wura. Enti sɛ me a meyɛ ofi no ti no wɔfrɛ me ‘Ɔbonsam’ a, dɛn din na wɔremfa mfrɛ mo!</char><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnsuro wɔn. Mmere bi bɛba a nokware no bɛda adi. Nea wɔyɛ no kokoa mu no nyinaa bɛda adi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/><char style="wj">Nea mereka akyerɛ mo wɔ sum mu yi, monka wɔ hann mu. Nea mereka agu mo asom yi, mompae mu nka wɔ adan atifi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/><char style="wj">Munnsuro wɔn a wobetumi akum mo nipadua nanso wɔrentumi nkum mo kra no. Onyankopɔn a obetumi akum onipadua no ne ɔkra wɔ amanehunu kurom no nko ara na munsuro no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/><char style="wj">Wɔtɔn akasanoma gye ahe? Nkasanoma abien bo nyɛ sika kakraa bi pɛ? Nanso akasanoma biara nni hɔ a obewu a mo Agya no nnim ho biribi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/><char style="wj">Mo tinwi mpo, wɔakan ne nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/><char style="wj">Enti munnsuro! Mosom bo ma Onyankopɔn sen nkasanoma.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔbɛka se onim me wɔ nnipa anim no, me nso mɛka se minim no mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no anim.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbɛka se onnim me wɔ nnipa anim no, me nso mɛka se minnim no wɔ mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no anim.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyɛ Asomdwoe, Ɛyɛ Ɔko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnsusuw sɛ mede asomdwoe na ɛbaa asase yi so! Ɛnyɛ asomdwoe na mmom afoa na mede bae.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/><char style="wj">Maba sɛ mɛma,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘ɔbabarima asɔre atia nʼagya,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="wj">na ɔbabea asɔre atia ne na,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="wj">na ɔbea warefo nso asɔre atia nʼasebea.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>
    <char style="wj">Obiara tamfo a ne ho yɛ hu no befi nʼankasa ne fi.’</char><verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nea ɔdɔ nʼagya anaa ne na kyɛn me no rentumi nyɛ me de. Saa ara na nea ɔdɔ ne babarima anaa ne babea kyɛn me no rentumi nyɛ me de ara ne no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi amfa nʼasennua na wammedi mʼakyi a, ɔrentumi nyɛ me de.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woma wo kra som wo bo a, wobɛhwere wo kra no, nanso sɛ me nti wohwere wo kra a, wo nsa bɛka.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ogye mo no gye me, na nea ogye me no nso gye Onyankopɔn a ɔsomaa me no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wugye odiyifo bi sɛ ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn nipa nti a, wobetua wo so ka sɛ odiyifo no ara pɛ. Na sɛ wugye nnipa trenee a, wubenya akatua sɛ onipa trenee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbɛma mʼakyidifo yi mu akumaa bi nsu anom no, onii no akatua remmɔ no da.”</char><verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Osuboni Yohane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu wiee nʼasuafo dumien no kasakyerɛ no, ofii hɔ kɔɔ nkurow a ɛbemmɛn no mu kɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ asɛm no.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Osuboni Yohane a saa bere no na ɔda afiase no tee anwonwade a Kristo reyɛ no, ɔsomaa nʼasuafo bebisaa no se, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>“Wo ne nea ɔreba no, anaa yɛnhwɛ ɔfoforo anim?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monsan nkɔ nkɔka anwonwade a moahu ne nea moate nkyerɛ Yohane se,</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/><char style="wj">anifuraefo hu ade, mmubuafo nantew, akwatafo ho fi, asotifo te asɛm, na awufo nso nyan. Afei monka nkyerɛ no se, meka asɛmpa no kyerɛ ahiafo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/><char style="wj">Monsan nka nkyerɛ no bio se, Nhyira ne wɔn a merento wɔn hintidua.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Yohane asuafo no kɔe no, Yesu fii ase kaa Yohane ho asɛm kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no. Obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mokɔɔ sare so no, dɛn na mokɔɔ sɛ morekɔhwɛ? Sare a mframa rebɔ no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/><char style="wj">Anaa na mususuw sɛ mubehu ɔbarima bi a wahyehyɛ sɛ ɔhene ba te ahemfi?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/><char style="wj">Anaa Onyankopɔn diyifo? Ɛno de, mereka akyerɛ mo se, nea muhuu no no sen odiyifo mpo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/><char style="wj">Na saa Yohane yi na Kyerɛwsɛm no ka fa ne ho se,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mɛsoma me bɔfo adi wʼanim kan.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">Ɔno na obesiesie ɔkwan ama wo.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Nokware ni, nnipa a mmea awo wɔn nyinaa mu, obiara nni hɔ a wagye din sɛ Osuboni Yohane. Nanso nea ɔyɛ aketewa koraa wɔ Ɔsoro Ahenni mu no yɛ ɔkɛse sen no!</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/><char style="wj">Na efi bere a Osuboni Yohane fii ase kaa asɛmpa no, bɔɔ nkurɔfo asu de besi nnɛ no, Ɔsoro Ahenni no de tumi retrɛw na nnipadɔm a wɔn ani abere no refa no anuɔden so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/><char style="wj">Ansa na Yohane rebɛba no, na adiyifo ne Mose mmara no aka ɔsoro ahenni no ho asɛm dedaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mopɛ sɛ mote nea mereka no ase de a, Yohane no, ɔno ne Elia a adiyifo no hyɛɛ ne ho nkɔm se ɔbɛba no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔwɔ aso no, ontie!</char><verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Dɛn ho na metumi de nnɛmmafo yi atoto? Wɔte sɛ mmofra a wɔte baabi redi agoru. Ɔfa ka kyerɛ ɔfa se,</char><verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Yɛtoo anigye nnwom maa mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">nso moansaw.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">Yɛtoo awerɛhow nnwom nso maa mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">
    <char style="wj">nanso moansu.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Yohane bae a onnidi na ɔnnom no, wose, ‘Ɔwɔ honhommɔne.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no bae a odidi na ɔnom no nso wose, ‘Monhwɛ odidifo ne ɔkɔwensani a ɔne towgyefo ne nnebɔneyɛfo fa nnamfo.’ Nanso nea efi Onyankopɔn nyansa mu ba no ma nokware da adi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Korasin, Betsaida Ne Kapernaum, Munnue!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Afei, ofii ase kaa nkurow a ɔyɛɛ anwonwade ahorow wɔ hɔ nanso wɔansakra wɔn adwene no anim se, <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/><char style="wj">“Korasin, due! Betsaida, due! Anwonwade a meyɛɛ no mo mu no, sɛ meyɛɛ no Tiro ne Sidon a, anka ɛhɔfo no de awerɛhow ne ahonu asakra wɔn adwene dedaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/><char style="wj">Atemmuda no, asɛm a ɛbɛto wɔn no bɛsen nea ɛbɛto Tiro ne Sidon!</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/><char style="wj">Na wo Kapernaum, wopɛ sɛ woma wo ho so, nanso wɔbɛbrɛ wo ase de wo akɔ amanehunu kurom. Anwonwade a meyɛɛ no wo hɔ no, sɛ wɔyɛɛ no Sodom a, anka ɛda so wɔ hɔ besi nnɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/><char style="wj">Mereka nokware akyerɛ mo se, atemmuda no, Tiro ne Sodom benya gyinabea pa asen mo!”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agya No Ayeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Asɛnka no akyi, Yesu bɔɔ mpae se, <char style="wj">“Agya, ɔsoro ne asase wura, meda wo ase sɛ woanna nokware no adi ankyerɛ wɔn a wosusuw sɛ wɔyɛ anyansafo, na mmom wodaa nokware no adi kyerɛɛ mmofra nkumaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/><char style="wj">Yiw, Agya, wopɛ mu na woma ɛbaa saa.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mʼagya no de nneɛma nyinaa ahyɛ me nsa. Obiara nnim Ɔba no gye Agya no nko ara. Na obiara nnim Agya no gye Ɔba no, ne wɔn a Ɔba no pɛ sɛ ɔda no adi kyerɛ wɔn.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo a moayɛ adwuma abrɛ na moasoa nnesoa nyinaa, mommra me nkyɛn, na mɛma mo ahome.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/><char style="wj">Momfa me konnua nto mo ho so, na munsua me, efisɛ midwo na mebrɛ me ho ase koma mu, na mubenya ɔhome ama mo kra.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/><char style="wj">Efisɛ me konnua yɛ mmerɛw, na mʼadesoa yɛ hare.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yɛ Homeda Wura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Homeda bi, Yesu ne nʼasuafo no kɔfaa aburowfuw bi mu. Wɔnam aburowfuw no mu no, ɔkɔm dee asuafo no ma wɔpenpan aburow no bi wee. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Farisifo bi huu nea asuafo no reyɛ no, anyɛ wɔn abodwo. Wobisaa Yesu se, “Woahu sɛ wʼasuafo no abu Homeda mmara no so?”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monkenkan nea Ɔhene Dawid yɛe, bere a ɔkɔm dee ɔne wɔn a na wɔka ne ho no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/><char style="wj">Wɔkɔɔ Onyankopɔn fi kodii brodo a wɔde abɔ afɔre, a anka wonni ho kwan sɛ wodi, gye ɔsɔfo nko ara no. Ɛno nso yɛ mmara so bu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/><char style="wj">Na monnsan nkenkan mfii Mose mmara no mu, sɛ asɔfo a wɔyɛ hyiadan mu adwuma no tumi yɛ adwuma Homeda nso?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/><char style="wj">Mereka ama moate ase sɛ, nea ɔkyɛn hyiadan no wɔ ha!</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moate asɛm a ese, ‘Mmɔborɔhunu na mepɛ na ɛnyɛ afɔrebɔ’ no ase yiye a, anka moremmu wɔn a wonni fɔ no fɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/><char style="wj">Na me, Onipa Ba no, meyɛ Homeda no wura.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu fii nea ɔwɔ hɔ no kɔɔ hyiadan mu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Ohuu ɔbarima bi wɔ ɔdan mu hɔ a na ne nsa baako awu. Farisifo no bisaa Yesu se, “Enti mmara ma ho kwan sɛ obi sa yare Homeda ana?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmara akyerɛkyerɛfo mma ayaresa ho kwan homeda; gye sɛ wohu sɛ, sɛ wɔansa ɔyarefo no yare da no ara na ade kye a, obewu. Obi a na ne nsa awu no de, na ɛnyɛ nea owu hunahuna no.</char></note> Wobisaa eyi sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wobenya kwan atoto nʼano na wɔakyere no!<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo mu hena na ɔwɔ oguan baako na sɛ ɔkɔtɔ amoa mu Homeda a, ɔrenyi no? Ɔkwan biara so wobɛkɔ akoyi no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/><char style="wj">Onipa som bo sen oguan! Eyi nti ɛwɔ ho kwan sɛ wɔyɛ papa Homeda.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Afei Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nea ne nsa awu no se, <char style="wj">“Teɛ wo nsa!”</char> Ɔyarefo no teɛɛ ne nsa. Ɔteɛɛ ne nsa no ahoɔden baa mu ma ɛyɛɛ sɛ baako no. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Farisifo no fii adi kotuu sɛnea wɔbɛkyere Yesu akum no no ho agyina.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Esiane sɛ na onim pɔw a wɔrebɔ wɔ ne ho no nti, ofii hyiadan no mu maa nnipadɔm dii nʼakyi. Ɔsaa wɔn mu ayarefo no nyinaa yare. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Nanso ɔbɔɔ wɔn ano se wɔmmmɔ nʼanwonwade a ɔyɛɛ no ho dawuru. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Na nkɔm a Odiyifo Yesaia hyɛɛ no aba mu se:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Monhwɛ mʼakoa a mayi no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">nea medɔ no a me kra ani sɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">mede me honhom begu no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">na wabu amanaman atɛn.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Ɔrenko, na ɔrenteɛteɛ mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Na obi rente ne nne wɔ abɔnten so!<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Ɔrensɛe demmire a ɛyɛ mmerɛw no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Kanea ntamabamma a ɛnnɛw yiye no, ɔrennum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">kosi sɛ ɔnam atɛntrenee so de nkonimdi bɛba.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Ne din bɛyɛ amanaman nyinaa anidaso.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisifo Ka Se Yesu Yɛ Ɔbonsam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Afei wɔde obi a ɔyɛ mum san yɛ onifuraefo, na honhommɔne nso wɔ ne so brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnsa no yare. Yesu saa no yare ma ɔkasae, san huu ade. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔwɔ hɔ no ho dwiriw wɔn. Wɔkae se, “Ebetumi aba sɛ Yesu yi yɛ Dawid Ba no, Agyenkwa no ana?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Nanso Farisifo no tee anwonwade a Yesu yɛe no, wɔkae se, “Ɔnam ahonhommɔne nyinaa panyin, Ɔbonsam Beelsebul no so na otu ahonhommɔne.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu huu wɔn adwene maa wɔn mmuae se, <char style="wj">“Ahemman biara a edi mpaapaemu no ntumi nnyina. Saa ara nso na kurow anaa ofi biara a edi mpaapaemu no ntumi nnyina.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔbonsam retu ɔbonsam a na ɛkyerɛ sɛ ɔne ne ho na ɛreko de asɛe nʼaheman.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ menam Beelsebul tumi so na mitu ahonhommɔne a, hena so na mo nkurɔfo nam tu ahonhommɔne? Saa na ɛte de a, mo nkurɔfo no ara na wobebu mo atɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/><char style="wj">Nanso sɛ menam Onyankopɔn Honhom so na mitu honhommɔne de a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn Ahenni no aba mo so.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obi ntumi nkɔ ɔhoɔdenfo fi mu nkowia no, agye sɛ onipa ko no di kan de hama kyekyere no.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a onni mʼafa no, tia me. Na nea ɔne me mmoaboa ano no hwete mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo se, wɔde bɔne ne abususɛm nyinaa bɛkyɛ nnipa, nanso abususɛm a etia Honhom Kronkron no de, wɔremfa nkyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔbɛkasa atia Onipa Ba no, wɔde bɛkyɛ no. Nanso nea ɔbɛkasa atia Honhom Kronkron no de, wɔremfa nkyɛ no da biara da.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dua Ne Nʼaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Dua biara aba na wɔde hu ne su. Dua pa sow aba pa na dua bɔne nso sow aba bɔne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/><char style="wj">Awɔ mma! Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na abɔnefo sɛ mo atumi aka nea eye ho asɛm? Nea ayɛ koma ma abu so no na ano ka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/><char style="wj">Onipa pa anom asɛm da nnepa a ɛwɔ ne mu no adi. Saa ara na onipa bɔne nso anom asɛm da nnebɔne a ɛwɔ ne mu no adi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/><char style="wj">Mereka makyerɛ mo se, atemmuda no, asɛnhunu biara a obi aka no, obebu ho akontaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/><char style="wj">Wʼanom asɛm so na wɔnam bebu wo bem anaa fɔ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yona Nsɛnkyerɛnne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Da bi, Yudafo mpanyimfo bi a Farisifo bi ka wɔn ho baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, ɔnyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne bi nkyerɛ wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɔman a wɔyɛ abɔnefo a wonni gyidi na wɔpɛ sɛ wohu nsɛnkyerɛnne. Nanso wɔrenhu nsɛnkyerɛnne biara ka Odiyifo Yona de no ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/><char style="wj">Na sɛnea Yona kodii bonsu yam nnansa no, saa ara na ɛsɛ sɛ Onipa Ba no kodi asase mu nnansa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/><char style="wj">Atemmuda no Ninewe mmarima ne nnɛmma bɛsɔre ayi ɔman yi atɛn, efisɛ bere a Yona kaa asɛmpa no, wɔsakraa wɔn adwene. Nanso nea ɔsen Yona wɔ ha.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/><char style="wj">Atemmuda no, Sebahemmea bɛsɔre atia ɔman yi, efisɛ ofi asase ano nohɔ betiee Salomo nyansa nsɛm. Nanso nea ɔsen Salomo no wɔ ha.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ɔman nnebɔneyɛfo yi te sɛ obi a honhommɔne wɔ ne so. Sɛ honhommɔne no tu fi ne mu a, ekyinkyin, hwehwɛ homebea nanso ennya bi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɛba saa a, nea honhommɔne no ka ne se, ‘Mɛsan akɔ onipa a mifii ne mu bae no mu bio.’ Ɔsan kɔ onipa no mu na ohu sɛ ne mu da mpan, na wɔasiesie hɔ fɛfɛɛfɛ a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/><char style="wj">ɔsan nʼakyi kɔfa ahonhommɔne afoforo ason a wɔyɛ den kyɛn no ba ma wɔn nyinaa bɛtena ne mu. Eyi ma onipa no asetena no sɛe kyɛn ne kan asetena no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Na Ne Ne Nuanom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Bere a Yesu reka asɛmpa akyerɛ nnipadɔm wɔ ofi bi mu no, ne na ne ne nuanom begyinaa afikyiri pɛɛ sɛ wɔne no kasa. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu baako kɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Wo na ne wo nuanom gyina afikyiri hɔ pɛ sɛ wɔne wo kasa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Hena ne me na? Ɛhefo ne me nuanom?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Ɔkaa saa no, ɔde ne nsa kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Eyinom ne me na ne me nuanom.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Ɔsan kaa bio se, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔbɛyɛ mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no apɛde no, ɔno ne me nuabarima, ne me nuabea ne me na.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ogufo Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Da no ara Yesu fii adi kɔtenaa mpoano. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Nnipakuw kyeree so wɔ hɔ a ɛmaa no kɔtenaa ɔkorow bi mu a na nnipakuw no nso gyinagyina mpoano hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Ofii ase kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn wɔ mmebu mu se, <char style="wj">“Da bi okuafo bi kɔɔ nʼafum koguu aba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/><char style="wj">Ogu so regu no, aba no bi guu ɔkwan mu maa nnomaa bɛsosɔw ne nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/><char style="wj">Bi nso koguu ɔbotan so. Ankyɛ na aba no fifii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ na dɔte a ɛwɔ ɔbotan no so sua no nti, owia bɔɔ so no, ne nyinaa hyewee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso guu nsɔe mu, na nsɔe no nyin no emiaa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi guu asase pa mu. Enyin, sow aba mmɔho aduasa; bi aduosia na afoforo nso ɔha.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔwɔ aso no, ma ontie!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nea Enti A Yesu Kasa Wɔ Mmebu Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Owiee ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no, nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Adɛn na daa wonam mmebu so kasa kyerɛ nnipa no?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo de, wɔde Ɔsoro Ahenni ho ahintasɛm ama mo na wɔn de, wɔmmfa mmaa wɔn ɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔwɔ biribi no, wɔbɛma no bi aka ho na wanya ama abu no so. Na nea onni ahe bi no, kakra a ɔwɔ no mpo, wobegye afi ne nsam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/><char style="wj">Nea enti a ɛma mekasa kyerɛ wɔn mmebu mu no ne sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">
    <char style="wj">“Wohu de, nanso wonhu;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">
    <char style="wj">wɔte de, na wɔnte ase.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Wɔn so na ɛnam ama Yesaia nkɔm a ɔhyɛe se,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɔte de, mobɛte, nanso morente ase;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="wj">ohu de, mubehu, nanso morenhu no, aba mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Efisɛ ɔman yi koma apirim.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">Wɔyɛ asoɔden;</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">wɔakatakata wɔn ani.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">Sɛ ɛnte saa a anka wɔn ani behu ade,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn aso ate asɛm</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">na wɔn koma ate asɛm ase,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="wj">na wɔanu wɔn ho asan aba me nkyɛn na masa wɔn yare.’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Na mo de, wɔahyira mo ani efisɛ ehu ade; wɔahyira mo aso efisɛ ɛte asɛm.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/><char style="wj">Na me de, mereka akyerɛ mo se, adiyifo ne atreneefo pii pɛɛ sɛ wohu nea muhu no, nanso wɔanhu. Wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔte nea mote no, nanso wɔante.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogufo Ho Bɛ No Nkyerɛase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei muntie bɛ a ɛfa ogufo a okoguu aba wɔ nʼafum no no nkyerɛase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wotie Onyankopɔn asɛm no, na wɔnte ase no te sɛ aba a eguu ɔkwan mu no. Ɔbɔnefo no ba, behwim nea wɔadua wɔ wɔn koma mu no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/><char style="wj">Aba a eguu ɔbotan so no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte asɛm no, na wɔde anigye so mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/><char style="wj">Nanso asɛm no nnyina wɔ wɔn mu. Eyi nti ɛnkyɛ na asɛm no awu. Esiane sɛ asɛm no awu nti, sɛ ɔhaw anaa ɔtaa bi ba a, wɔpa abaw.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/><char style="wj">Aba a eguu nsɔe mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wotie asɛm no, nanso wiase yi mu abrabɔ mu haw ne agyapade ho dadwen nti ɛmma asɛm no ntumi nyɛ wɔn mu adwuma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/><char style="wj">Na aba a eguu asase pa mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wotie asɛm no, na wɔte ase. Wɔsow aba mmɔho aduasa; bi aduosia; na afoforo nso, ɔha.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nwura Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu de bɛ foforo kaa asɛm se, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni no te sɛ okuafo bi a oduaa aburow wɔ nʼafum.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/><char style="wj">Da koro anadwo a wada no, ne tamfo nso beduaa nwura fraa aburow a wadua no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/><char style="wj">Aburow no renyin no, na nwura no nso renyin.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Okuafo no apaafo bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, ‘Owura, aburow a wuduae no, nwura bi afifi wɔ ase!’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Okuafo no buae se, ‘Ɔtamfo bi na oduae!’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">
    <char style="wj">“Apaafo no bisaa no se, ‘Wopɛ sɛ yekotutu saa nwura no ana?’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obuaa wɔn se, ‘Dabi da!’ Anyɛ a na moatutu aburow no bi afra nwura no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/><char style="wj">Momma ne nyinaa nyin nkosi twabere na mama atwafo ayiyi nwura no afi aburow no mu ahyew no, na wɔde aburow no nso agu asan so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyaa Aba Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu buu wɔn bɛ foforo se, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni te sɛ onyaa aba ketewa bi a obi duaa wɔ nʼafum.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/><char style="wj">Ɛyɛ aba ketewaa bi, nanso sɛ enyin a, ɛyɛ dutan kɛse ma nnomaa kosisi ne mman so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmɔkaw Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Obuu wɔn bɛ foforo se, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni te sɛ mmɔkaw bi a brodotofo de fɔtɔw mmɔre ma etu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu nam mmebu so ɔkasa kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Enti ɔhyɛɛ nea adiyifo no ahyɛ ho nkɔm no mma se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Mɛkasa mmebu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">na maka anwonwade mu ahintasɛm a efi adebɔ mfiase.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nwura Ho Bɛ No Nkyerɛase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Afei Yesu fii nnipadɔm no nkyɛn kɔɔ fie. Nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se ɔnkyerɛ wɔn bɛ a ɛfa nwura ne aburow ho no ase.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Me Onipa Ba no, mene okuafo a oduaa aburow no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/><char style="wj">Afuw no ne wiase, na aburow no nso gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔyɛ Ahenni no mma; nwura no nso gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔyɛ ɔbonsam mma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/><char style="wj">Ɔtamfo a oduaa nwura fraa aburow no ne ɔbɔnefo no. Otwabere no yɛ wiase awiei; atwafo no ne abɔfo no.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛnea asɛnka no mu, wotutuu nwura no fii aburow no mu kɔhyew no no, saa ara na ɛbɛyɛ wɔ wiase awiei.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no bɛsoma nʼabɔfo, na wɔabɛboaboa wɔn a wɔpɛ bɔne, nsɛmmɔnedifo nyinaa ano afi Ahenni no mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/><char style="wj">na wɔatow wɔn agu ogyatannaa no mu, ahyew wɔn. Ɛhɔ na osu ne setwɛre wɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/><char style="wj">Na atreneefo no bɛhyerɛn sɛ owia wɔ wɔn Agya Ahenni no mu. Nea ɔwɔ aso no, ma ontie!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ademude Ne Ahene Pa Ho Mmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>Yesu toaa mmebu no so se, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni no te sɛ ademude bi a obi kohuu wɔ afuw bi mu.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tete no, esiane sɛ na sikakorabea biara nni baabi nti, na wɔde ademude sie fam.</char></note> <char style="wj">Ɔkataa so, na ɔde ahopere kɔtɔn nʼahode nyinaa, de kɔtɔɔ afuw no.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bio, Ɔsoro Ahenni te sɛ obi a odi nhene pa ho gua a ɔrehwehwɛ nhene pa atɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/><char style="wj">Okonyaa bi a ɛyɛ fɛ mmoroso, enti ɔkɔtɔn nʼahode nyinaa de kɔtɔe!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaugu Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>Yesu toaa so bio se, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni no te sɛ obi a okoguu asau wɔ asu bi mu yii nsumnam ahorow bebree.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/><char style="wj">Asau no yɛɛ ma no, ɔtwe baa konkɔn so. Afei ɔtenaa ase yiyii nam pa no guu kɛntɛn mu na ɔtow nea enye no gui.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na wiase awiei bɛyɛ. Abɔfo no bɛba abɛpaw abɔnefo no afi atreneefo no mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/><char style="wj">na wɔatow abɔnefo no agu ogyatannaa no mu; ɛhɔ na osu ne setwɛre wɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mote ase?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Nʼasuafo no buaa no se, “Yiw.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesu toaa ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no so se, <char style="wj">“Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo a wɔabɛyɛ mʼasuafo no te sɛ ofiwura a wada nʼagyapade foforo ne dedaw nyinaa adi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔpo Yesu Wɔ Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu wiee ne mmebu no, ofii faako a ɔwɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>Ɔkɔɔ ne kurom Nasaret. Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ hyiadan mu maa wɔn a wotiee no no ho dwiriw wɔn. Wobisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho se, “Ɛhe na saa ɔbarima yi konyaa nyansa a ɔde yɛ anwonwade sɛɛ yi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Ɛnyɛ dua dwumfo no ba no ni? Ɛnyɛ ne na ne Maria? Ɛnyɛ ne nua barimanom ne Yakobo ne Yosef ne Simon ne Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Ɛnyɛ yɛne ne nuabeanom na ɛte ha? Na afei ɛhe na okonyaa eyinom nyinaa yi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Wɔn bo fuw no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Odiyifo wɔ anuonyam baabiara, gye ne man mu anaa ne nkurɔfo mu!”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Esiane sɛ wɔannye no anni no nti, wanyɛ anwonwade bebree wɔ hɔ!<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Osuboni Yohane Kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Bere no mu ara na Herode a na odi hene wɔ Galilea no tee Yesu nka, <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfo ne se, “Oyi yɛ Osuboni Yohane na wasɔre afi awufo mu. Eyi nti na wanya tumi foforo de reyɛ anwonwade ahorow yi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Saa bere no na Herode ama wɔakyere Osuboni Yohane ato afiase, efisɛ na wakasa atia Herodia ne Herode aware no <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>sɛ, Herode aware ne nua Filipo yere. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Herode pɛɛ sɛ okum Yohane. Nanso na osuro sɛ, sɛ okum no a basabasayɛ bɛba ɔman no mu. Efisɛ na nnipa no nyinaa bu Yohane sɛ odiyifo.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Ɛbaa sɛ na Herode redi nʼawoda. Awoda no ase na Herodia babea bɛsaw ma a ɛyɛɛ Herode fɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Eyi maa Herode kaa ntam, hyɛɛ no bɔ se ommisa nea ɔpɛ biara na ɔde bɛma no. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Ne na maa no kae se, “Fa Osuboni Yohane ti a wɔatwa to prɛte mu ma me wɔ ha.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Herode tee asɛm no, ɛyɛɛ no yaw ma ɛhaw no. Nanso esiane ntam a waka wɔ nnipa a wɔahyia hɔ no anim no nti, ɔhyɛ ma wɔyɛɛ nea ababaa no hwehwɛ no maa no. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Herode soma ma wokotwaa Yohane ti wɔ afiase hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Wɔde ti a wɔatwa no too prɛte mu de brɛɛ ababaa no ma ɔde kɔmaa ne na. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Yohane asuafo no bɛfaa nʼamu no kosiee no. Eyi akyi no wɔkɔbɔɔ Yohane wu no ho amanneɛ kyerɛɛ Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nnipa Mpem Anum Aduan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu tee Osuboni Yohane wu no, ɔtew ne ho kɔtenaa baabi. Nnipa tee ne nka ma wɔnam fam fi wɔn nkurow ne wɔn nkuraa tiw no kɔɔ nea ɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesu fii ɔkorow no mu baa nea nnipa no wɔ hɔ no. Ohuu nnipadɔm no, ne yam hyehyee no maa wɔn. Eyi ma ɔsaa ayarefo a wɔwɔ wɔn mu no yare.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Anim rebiribiri no, Yesu asuafo no baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ade asa awie. Aduan biara nso nni ha. Ɛha nso mmɛn kurow biara. Enti gya nnipa no kwan, na wɔnkɔhwehwɛ aduan ntɔ nni wɔ nkurow no bi so.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛho nhia sɛ wɔkɔ; momma wɔn aduan nni!”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Asuafo no ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Nea yɛwɔ nyinaa yɛ brodo anum ne mpataa abien pɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Momfa mmrɛ me.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no ma wɔtenatenaa ase wɔ sare no so. Ɔhwɛɛ soro bɔɔ mpae, hyiraa aduan no so. Afei obubuu mu de maa nʼasuafo no ma wɔkyekyɛ maa nnipadɔm no. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Obiara dii nea wɔde maa no no mee pintinn. Afei asuafo no boaboaa nea wodi ma ɛkae no ano no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛn dumien. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Mmarima a wodii aduan no dodow bɛyɛ mpem anum a mmea ne mmofra no dodow nka ho.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nantew Nsu Ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Nnipadɔm no didi wiee pɛ na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, wɔntena ɔkorow no mu nni kan ntwa nkɔ asuogya nohɔ na ɔno de, ɔretena hɔ agya nnipa no kwan. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Ogyaa wɔn kwan wiee no, ɔkɔɔ bepɔw bi so kɔbɔɔ mpae. Onwini dwoe no, na aka Yesu nko ara wɔ nea ɔwɔ hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Saa bere no na ɔkorow a asuafo no te mu no adu akyiri. Mframa fii ase bɔɔ dennen maa po no bɔɔ asorɔkye dwiradwiraa ɔkorow no a asuafo no te mu no.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Anɔpahema bɛyɛ nnɔnnan bere mu no, Yesu nantew po no ani baa asuafo no nkyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Bere a asuafo no huu obi sɛ ɔnam asu no ani reba wɔn nkyɛn no wosuroe, efisɛ na wosusuw sɛ wɔahu ɔsaman. Ɛmaa wɔde hu teɛteɛɛ mu.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Ntɛm ara na Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ me. Munnsuro. Momma mo bo ntɔ mo yam!”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Awurade, sɛ ɛyɛ wo de a, ka kyerɛ me na me nso memfa asu no ani mmra wo nkyɛn.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Petro se, <char style="wj">“Bra!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Petro fii ɔkorow no mu sii asu no ani, nantew sɛ ɔrekɔ Yesu nkyɛn. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Nanso ohuu mframa a ɛrebɔ no ne ho popoe. Ofii ase sɛ ɔremem. Ɔteɛteɛɛ mu, frɛɛ Yesu se, “Awurade, gye me na meremem!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Yesu teɛɛ ne nsa twee no. Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ Petro se, <char style="wj">“Wo a wo gyidi sua, adɛn na wunnye me nni?”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Yesu ne Petro kɔtenaa ɔkorow no mu no, mframa no gyaee bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Asuafo a wɔwɔ ɔkorow no mu no de ahodwiriw bɛkotow Yesu kae se, “Onyankopɔn Ba ne wo ampa!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Genesaret Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Wotwaa asu no baa Genesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Yesu duu hɔ no, ankyɛ na nkurow a atwa Genesaret ho ahyia no nyinaa tee ne nka. Wɔde wɔn ayarefo nyinaa brɛɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Ayarefo no srɛɛ Yesu se ɔmma wɔmfa wɔn nsa nka nʼatade ano kɛkɛ. Ayarefo dodow a wotumi de wɔn nsa kaa nʼatade ano no ho yɛɛ wɔn den.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Nea Egu Obi Ho Fi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Da bi, Farisifo ne Yudafo mpanyin no bi fi Yerusalem baa Yesu nkyɛn bebisaa no se, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Adɛn nti na wʼasuafo no nni Yudafo amanne so? Yɛn amanne a yɛhohoro yɛn nsa ho ansa na yɛadidi no, wonni so.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na mo nso mode mo amanne no bu Onyankopɔn mmaransɛm so?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/><char style="wj">Ebi ne sɛ, Onyankopɔn mmara no ka se, ‘Di wʼagya ne wo na ni,’ na baako nso ne sɛ, ‘Obiara a ɔbɛka asɛmmɔne afa nʼawofo ho no, ɛsɛ sɛ wokum no,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/><char style="wj">Na mo de, nea moka ne sɛ, sɛ obi ka kyerɛ ne na anaa nʼagya se, ‘Mewɔ ade bi a anka metumi de aboa mo, nanso mede rekɔma Onyankopɔn’ a, ɛnyɛ bɔne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/><char style="wj">Enti mo ara monam mo mmara a moahyɛ so bu Onyankopɔn mmara a ɔhyɛɛ sɛ di wʼagya ne wo na ni no so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/><char style="wj">Mo nyaatwomfo! Sɛ Yesaia hyɛɛ mo ho nkɔm sɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Saa nnipa yi ka sɛ wodi me ni,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="wj">nanso wɔn koma mmɛn me.</char><verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Wɔsom me ani so kɛkɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="wj">efisɛ wɔkyerɛkyerɛ mmara a onipa ayɛ na ɛnyɛ nea efi Onyankopɔn.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Afei Yesu frɛɛ nnipadɔm no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Muntie nea meka no na mommɔ mmɔden nte ase. <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/><char style="wj">Ɛnyɛ ade a ɛbɛkɔ onipa mu no na ɛmma ne ho ntew, na mmom, nea ebefi ne mu aba no na egu ne ho fi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Nsɛm a Yesu kaa yi maa nʼasuafo no ba bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Wunim sɛ wo nsɛm a wokaa no ama Farisifo no bo afuw?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Dua biara a ɛnyɛ mʼagya na oduae no, wobetu akyene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/><char style="wj">Mummmua wɔn koraa! Na wɔyɛ anifuraefo a wɔrekyerɛ anifuraefo kwan nti wɔn nyinaa bɛkɔ akɔtew ahwe amoa mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ Yesu se, “Kyerɛ yɛn bɛ no ase.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu nso bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Ampa ara sɛ monte ase?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/><char style="wj">Munnim sɛ ade a ɛfa onipa anom no fa onipadua no mu na asan aba bio?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/><char style="wj">Asɛm a ho ntew biara fi koma a mu ntew mu ma egu nea ɔkaa saa asɛm no ho fi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/><char style="wj">Koma mu na adwemmɔne, awudi, ayefasɛm, aguamammɔ, korɔn, atoro ne ntwatoso fi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/><char style="wj">Eyinom na egu onipa ho fi. Nanso sɛ obi anhohoro ne nsa sɛnea mo amanne te no na odidi a, ne ho nguu fi honhom mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanaanni Bea Bi Gyidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu fii ɔman no mu hɔ kɔɔ Tiro ne Sidon. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Kanaanni bea bi a ɔte ɔman no mu hɔ de osu baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛkae se, “Awurade, Dawid Ba, hu me mmɔbɔ! Honhommɔne hyɛ me ba mu na sɛ ɛka ne ho a, ɛma ne ho yeraw no.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Yesu anka hwee. Nʼasuafo no hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔmpam ɔbea no mfi hɔ. Wotii mu ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ka kyerɛ no na omfi ha nkɔ, na ɔde nʼadesrɛ no retuatua yɛn aso.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbea no se, <char style="wj">“Wɔsomaa me baa Yudafo, Israel nguan a wɔayera no nkyɛn na ɛnyɛ amanamanmufo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Ɔba bɛkotow no kɔɔ so srɛɛ no se, “Me wura, boa me!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Enye sɛ wobegye aduan afi mmofra nsam atow ama akraman.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Ɔbea no nso buae se, “Ɛwɔ mu saa de, nanso akraman no nso tumi di mporoporowa a efi wɔn wura no pon so gu fam no.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbea no se, <char style="wj">“Ɔbea, wo gyidi mu yɛ den. Mɛyɛ wʼabisade ama wo.”</char> Ɛhɔ ara, ne babea no ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa Ahorow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu san baa Galilea po no ho. Ɔforo kɔtenaa bepɔw bi so. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Nnipa bebree de mpakye, anifuraefo, apirafo, mum ne wɔn a wɔyare nyarewa ahorow baa ne nkyɛn sɛ ɔnsa wɔn yare, ma ɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yare. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Nnipa no ho dwiriw wɔn. Wɔn a wɔnkasaa da kasae; mpakye nyaa ahoɔden; na mmubuafo nantew huruhuruwii na anifuraefo huu ade. Nnipadɔm no ho dwiriw wɔn ma wɔkamfoo Israel Nyankopɔn.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa Mpem Anan Aduanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Afei Yesu frɛɛ nʼasuafo no nyinaa baa ne nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Nnipa yi yɛ me mmɔbɔ. Wɔabedi me nkyɛn ha nnansa. Aduan a ɛwɔ ha nyinaa nso asa. Nanso mempɛ sɛ mema wɔkɔ wɔn afi mu a wonnidii, anyɛ saa a, wɔbɛtotɔ piti wɔ kwan so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Nʼasuafo no nso bisaa no se, “Sare so ha de, ɛhe na yebenya nnipadɔm yi ano aduan?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Brodo dodow ahe na mowɔ?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wobuae se, “Yɛwɔ brodo ason ne mpataa kakraa bi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no maa wɔn nyinaa tenatenaa ase wɔ sare no so. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Afei ɔfaa brodo ason no ne mpataa no, hyiraa so na obubuu mu de maa asuafo no se wɔmfa mma nnipadɔm no nni. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Wɔn nyinaa dii aduan no mee pintinn. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Wɔn a wodii saa aduan no, na wɔn dodow yɛ nnipa mpem anan a wɔankan mmea ne mmofra anka ho. Wodidi wiei no, akyi mporoporowa a wɔtasee no yɛɛ nkɛntɛn ason. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Eyi akyi na Yesu gyaa nkurɔfo no kwan, maa ɔno nso kɔtenaa ɔkorow mu twa kɔɔ Magadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Farisifo Ne Sadukifo Pɛ Nsɛnkyerɛnne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Da koro bi, Farisifo ne Sadukifo baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛsɔɔ no hwɛɛ wɔ frɛ a ɔfrɛ ne ho sɛ Onyankopɔn Ba no ho. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no se ɔnyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne bi a efi ɔsoro nkyerɛ wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Munim wim nsakrae ho nkyerɛase. Sɛ owia rekɔtɔ, na wim yɛ kɔkɔɔ a, moka se ɔkyena wim bɛtew.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ edu anɔpa na wim yɛ kɔɔ a, moka se wim rentew da mu no nyinaa. Nanso muntumi nkyerɛ mmere mu nsɛnkyerɛnne no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/><char style="wj">Saa ɔman nnebɔneyɛfo a wonnye hwee nni yi hwehwɛ sɛ wobehu ɔsoro nsɛnkyerɛnne bi, nanso wɔrenhu nsɛnkyerɛnne foforo biara ka anwonwade a woyi kyerɛɛ Yona no ho.”</char> Yesu kaa saa wiee no, ogyaw wɔn hɔ kɔe.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisifo Ne Sadukifo Mmɔkaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Asuafo no twa kɔɔ asuogya nohɔ no, wɔkae se anka ɛsɛ sɛ wɔfa aduan. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yiye wɔ Farisifo ne Sadukifo nyaatwom a ɛte sɛ mmɔkaw no ho.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Asuafo no susuw sɛ gyama wonkura aduan biara no nti na Yesu kaa saa.<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu huu nea wodwinnwen no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo a mo gyidi sua! Adɛn na ɛhaw mo sɛ moamfa aduan?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/><char style="wj">Enti ebesi nnɛ monte ase ana? Mo werɛ afi brodo anum a mibubuu mu maa nnipa mpem anum no ne ase mporoporowa kɛntɛn a ɛkae no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/><char style="wj">Mo werɛ asan afi brodo ason a mede maa nnipa mpem anan ne nea ɛkae no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/><char style="wj">Adɛn nti na modwene sɛ aduan ho asɛm na mereka akyerɛ mo? Meresan aka bio sɛ, ‘Monhwɛ mo ho yiye wɔ Farisifo ne Sadukifo mmɔkaw ho.’ ”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Afei asuafo no tee nea ɔkae no ase sɛ, Farisifo ne Sadukifo mmɔkaw ho asɛm a ɔreka akyerɛ no yɛ Farisifo ne Sadukifo nkyerɛkyerɛ bɔne bi no ho asɛm na ɔreka.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Kyerɛ Onipa Ko A Yesu Yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Bere a Yesu baa Kaesarea Filipi fam no, obisaa nʼasuafo no se <char style="wj">“Nnipa ka se Onipa Ba no ne hena?”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Wobuaa no se, “Ebinom se wone Yohane Osuboni. Ebinom nso se Elia. Afoforo nso se wone Yeremia anaa adiyifo no mu baako.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Afei Yesu bisaa wɔn se <char style="wj">“Na mo nso, muse mene hena?”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Petro buaa no se, “Wone Kristo no, Onyankopɔn Teasefo no Ba no!”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne wo, Yona ba Simon. Efisɛ ɛnyɛ onipa na oyii eyi kyerɛɛ wo, na mmom ɛyɛ mʼAgya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/><char style="wj">Wone Petro, Ɔbotan, na ɔbotan yi so na mede mʼasafo besi, na tumi a ɛwɔ ɔbonsam gya mu no rentumi mmubu no da.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/><char style="wj">Mede Ɔsoro Ahenni no safe bɛma wo, na ɔpon biara a wobɛto mu wɔ asase so no, wɔbɛto mu wɔ ɔsoro; na ɔpon biara a wubebue wɔ asase so no, wobebue wɔ ɔsoro!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Afei Yesu bɔɔ nʼasuafo no ano se wɔnnka nkyerɛ obiara sɛ ɔno ne Agyenkwa no.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Wu Ne Ne Wusɔre Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Efi saa bere no, Yesu fii ase kyerɛkyerɛɛ ɔkɔ a ɔbɛkɔ Yerusalem, ne amane a obehu wɔ Yudafo mpanyin, asɔfo mpanyin ne kyerɛwfo ne akyerɛkyerɛfo no nsam na wɔakum no, na nnansa so no wanyan no mu pefee kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Petro frɛɛ Yesu kɔɔ nkyɛn na ɔkaa nʼanim se, “Adɛn nti na woka asɛm a ɛte saa! Onyame mpa ngu! Nea woreka yi remma wo so da!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Yesu dan ne ho kaa Petro anim se, <char style="wj">“Ɔbonsam, fi me so! Woyɛ hintidua kɛse ma me. Wudwen nnipa adwene na ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn de.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ odi mʼakyi a, ɔmpa ne ho akyi, na ɔmma nʼasennua so, na onni mʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ogye ne kra nkwa no, ebefi ne nsa, na obiara a me nti, ne kra befi ne nsa no, ne nsa bɛsan aka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ onipa nya wiase yi mu nneɛma nyinaa na ɔhwere ne kra a, mfaso bɛn na obenya? Dɛn na onipa betumi de asi ne kra anan mu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/><char style="wj">Na me, Onipa Ba no, mɛba wɔ mʼagya anuonyam mu a mʼabɔfo ka me ho na mabebu obiara nneyɛe ho atɛn.</char><verse eid="MAT 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nokware mise mo sɛ: Mo mu bi renwu kosi sɛ mubehu Onipa Ba no sɛ ɔreba nʼahenni mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Anuonyam Hyerɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Nnansia akyi no Yesu faa Petro, Yakobo ne ne nua Yohane de wɔn kɔɔ bepɔw tenten bi a so yɛ dinn atifi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Wɔwɔ hɔ no, wohuu sɛ ne nipadua asakra ama nʼanim ahyerɛn sɛ owia, ma nʼatade ayɛ fitafita sɛ nwera. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Prɛko pɛ, Mose ne Elia bepuee hɔ a na wɔne Yesu rekasa.<verse eid="MAT 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Petro kae se, “Awurade, ɛyɛ nwonwa sɛ yɛn nso yɛwɔ ha bi. Sɛ wopɛ a, anka mɛbɔ asese abiɛsa na mede baako ama wo, na mede baako ama Mose, na mede baako ama Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Petro gu so rekasa no, omununkum hann bi bɛkataa wɔn so na nne bi fi omununkum no mu kae se, “Oyi ne me Dɔba a ɔsɔ mʼani. Muntie no!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Asuafo no tee nne no, wɔbɔɔ hu ma wɔde wɔn anim butubutuw fam. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yesu baa wɔn nkyɛn, besusoo wɔn mu kae se, <char style="wj">“Monsɔre! Munnsuro!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Wɔmaa wɔn ani so no, wɔanhu obiara sɛ Yesu nko ara.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Ɛbaa sɛ wɔresian afi bepɔw no so no, Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano se, <char style="wj">“Monnka nea moahu no nkyerɛ obiara kosi sɛ menyan afi awufo mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elia Ba A Ɛto So Abien Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Yesu asuafo no bisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na daa Yudafo mpanyin ka ti mu se, ɛsɛ sɛ Elia san ba ansa na Agyenkwa no aba?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Nea wɔreka no wɔ mu. Ɛsɛ sɛ Elia di kan ba bɛtoto nneɛma yiye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/><char style="wj">Na nokware ni, Elia aba dedaw na wɔanhu no, na dodow no ara ne no anni no yiye. Na me, Agyenkwa no nso, mehu amane wɔ wɔn nsam saa ara.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Afei asuafo no hui sɛ Osuboni Yohane ho asɛm na ɔreka no.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otwafo Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Bere a osian duu bepɔw no ase no, ohuu sɛ nnipadɔm retwɛn no. Ɔbarima bi bebuu Yesu nkotodwe kae se, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>“Owura, hu me ba bi a otwa mmɔbɔ, efisɛ ɔwɔ ɔhaw kɛse mu. Sɛ otwa no ba a, etumi twa no hwe ogya anaa nsu mu. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Enti mede no brɛɛ wʼasuafo no sɛ wɔnsa no yare; nanso wɔantumi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Mo nnɛ mma asoɔdenfo a munni gyidi! Me ne mo ntena nkosi da bɛn? Momfa no mmrɛ me wɔ ha.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu teɛteɛɛ honhommɔne a ɛwɔ abarimaa no mu no ma etu fii ne mu ma amono mu hɔ ara ne ho tɔɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyidi Mu Tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Afei asuafo no baa Yesu nkyɛn wɔ kokoa mu bebisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na yɛantumi antu honhommɔne no?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Efisɛ mo gyidi sua.”</char> Ɔtoaa so se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mowɔ gyidi sɛ onyaa aba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">egyina hɔ ma sinapi aba.</char></note> <char style="wj">a esua koraa no a, anka mubetumi aka akyerɛ bepɔw yi se, ‘Tutu kɔ nohɔ!’ na ebetutu akɔ akyirikyiri.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/><char style="wj">Na saa honhommɔne a ɛte sɛɛ yi de, ɛrentumi ntu da, gye sɛ monam mpaebɔ ne mmuadadi so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Wu Ho Nkɔm A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Da bi a Yesu ne nʼasuafo no wɔ Galilea no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Wɔrebeyi Onipa Ba no de no ahyɛ wɔn a</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/><char style="wj">wɔwɔ tumi no nsa, na wɔakum no na ne nnansa so no, wanyan aba nkwa mu bio.”</char> Asuafo no tee saa asɛm yi no, wɔn werɛ howee, na wɔn koma nso tui.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tua Asɔredan Mu Tow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Bere a wobeduu Kapernaum no nso, ɛhɔ asɔre no mu towgyefo baa Petro nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Enti wo wura tua tow?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Petro buaa no se, “Yiw otua.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petro fii hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ fie kɔbɔɔ Yesu amanneɛ a ɛfa towtua no ho. Yesu amma nʼano ansi koraa na obisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Na wo Petro, wo nso wudwen ho dɛn? Ahemfo twa tow ma wɔn ara wɔn manfo tua anaasɛ wotwa ma ahɔho a wodi wɔn so no?”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Petro buaa se, “Wotwa tow no ma ahɔho no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu nso buae se, <char style="wj">“Petro mo! Ɛno de na ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔman mma no tua tow biara.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/><char style="wj">Na mmom, esiane sɛ mempɛ sɛ wɔfa yɛn ho abufuw no nti, kɔ asu no mu kɔto darewa. Apataa a wubeyi no adi kan no, bue nʼanom. Wubehu sika a ɛbɛso me ne wo tow no tua sɛ ɛhyɛ nʼanom; yi na fa kotua ma wɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkɛse Koraa Wɔ Ɔsoro Ahenni Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Saa bere no mu na Yesu asuafo no baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, wɔn mu hena na ɔbɛyɛ kɛse Ɔsoro Ahenni no mu.<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu frɛɛ abofra ketewa bi de no begyinaa wɔn mfimfini. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate ase sɛ, gye sɛ motwe mo ho fi mo bɔne ho, na moyɛ sɛ mmofra nketewa, na mode mo ho ma Onyankopɔn ansa na mubetumi akɔ Ɔsoro Ahenni no mu.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/><char style="wj">Enti, obiara a ɔbɛbrɛ ne ho ase sɛ abofra yi no, ɔno na ɔbɛyɛ ɔkɛse koraa wɔ Ɔsoro Ahenni mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/><char style="wj">Na mo mu biara a, me nti obegye abofra ketewa biara te sɛ oyi no, wagye me nso aba ne nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti sɛ obi to mmofra nketewa a wogye me di yi bi hintidua a, eye ma no sɛ anka wɔde ɔbotan bɛsɛn ne kɔn mu atow no akyene po mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/><char style="wj">Wiase nnue wɔ ne hintiduato ho! Hintiduato wɔ hɔ de, nanso nea ɛnam ne so bɛba no nnue.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/><char style="wj">Enti sɛ wo nsa anaa wo nan to wo hintidua a, twa na tow kyene. Eye ma wo sɛ wode dɛmdi bɛkɔ ɔsoro sen sɛ wɔde wo nipamu bɛto ogyatannaa mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wʼani to wo hintidua a, tu na tow kyene. Eye ma wo sɛ wode ani koro bɛkɔ ɔsoro sen sɛ wowɔ ani abien na wɔde wo bɛto amanehunu gya mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oguan A Wayera No Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ yiye na moammu saa mmofra nketewa yi mu baako koraa animtiaa. Mereka akyerɛ mo se, ɔsoro hɔ no, wɔn abɔfo wɔ mʼagya nkyɛn daa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/><char style="wj">Na me, Agyenkwa no, mebae sɛ merebegye wɔn a wɔayera no nkwa.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ onipa bi wɔ nguan ɔha, na wɔn mu baako kokyin na ɔyera a, dɛn na ɔbɛyɛ? Ɔrennyaw aduɔkron akron no hɔ nkokyinkyin mmepɔw so ne abon mu nhwehwɛ nea wayera no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɛba sɛ ohu saa oguan no a, nʼani gye ne ho sen aduɔkron akron a wɔwɔ fie no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no mpɛ sɛ nketewa yi mu baako bɛyera.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wʼasɛde Wɔ Onua Fom Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wo nua fom wo a, kɔ ne nkyɛn na wo ne no baanu no nka nea ɔyɛɛ wo a ɛnyɛ wo dɛ no. Sɛ otie nea woka no, na ɔte ne ho ase a, onua ayɛ onua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ wantie nso a, san fa onipa baako anaa baanu ka wo ho kɔ ne nkyɛn, na nnipa baanu anaa baasa no adi nea ebesi wɔ hɔ no nyinaa ho adanse.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wantie wo ara a, fa asɛm no kɔma asafo. Na sɛ wudi bem wɔ asafo no anim, na ɔnte ne ho ase ara a, asafo no mpam no mfi wɔn mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka akyerɛ mo se, biribiara a mokyekyere wɔ asase so no, wɔakyekyere wɔ ɔsoro, na biribiara a moasan wɔ asase so no, wɔasan wɔ ɔsoro.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Meresan aka akyerɛ mo bio se, sɛ mo mu baanu biara a ɔte asase yi so hwehwɛ biribi na ɔde nokware bisa mʼagya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no a, ɔbɛyɛ ama no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/><char style="wj">Na nea baanu anaa baasa ahyia wɔ me din mu no, na mewɔ wɔn mfimfini.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpaani Tirimuɔdenfo No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Petro baa Yesu nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Awurade, mpɛn ahe na sɛ me nua fom me a memfa nkyɛ no? Mpɛn ason ana?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Dabi! Mpɛn aduɔson ahorow ason!</char><verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni no te sɛ ɔhene bi a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔne nʼapaafo bu nkontaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/><char style="wj">Nkontaabu no mu no, wɔde ɔpaani bi a ɔde no ka sika ɔpepem du brɛɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ na onni sika a ɔde betua ka no nti, ɔhene no hyɛɛ sɛ wɔntɔn ɔne ne yere ne ne mma ne biribiara a ɔwɔ, na wɔmfa mmetua ka no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔpaani yi de nʼanim butuw fam, srɛɛ ne wura yi sɛ, ‘Me wura, hu me mmɔbɔ, na tɔ wo bo ase ma me, na mɛba abetua ka a mede wo no nyinaa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/><char style="wj">Ɔpaani yi asɛm a ɔkae no yɛɛ ɔhene no mmɔbɔ, ma ogyaa no de ne ka no nyinaa nso kyɛɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ɔpaani yi fii hɔ no, okohuu ne yɔnko paani bi a ɔde no ka sika kakraa bi. Otim no amene sɛ ontua no ka a ɔde no no wɔ hɔ ara.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na ne yɔnko paani no kotow paa no kyɛw sɛ ɔntɔ ne bo ase mma no, na obetua ka no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso ɔno de, wampene. Ɔma wɔde no kɔtoo afiase se gye sɛ watua no ka a ɔde no no nyinaa ansa na ɔbɛma wɔagyaa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/><char style="wj">Ɔkafo yi nnamfo kɔkaa asɛm a asi no nyinaa kyerɛɛ ɔhene no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔhene no tee no, ɔfrɛɛ saa ɔpaani a ɔde ne ho kyɛɛ no no baa nʼanim. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, ‘Onipa bɔne ne otirimɔdenfo! Wosrɛɛ me no, mede ka kɛse a wode me no nyinaa kyɛɛ wo;</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/><char style="wj">ɛnsɛ wo sɛ wo nso wuhu wo yɔnko mmɔbɔ sɛnea mihuu wo mmɔbɔ no ana?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/><char style="wj">Ɔhene no de abufuw ma wɔde ɔpaani yi kɔtoo afiase kae se, gye sɛ watua ka a ɔde no no nyinaa ansa na ɔbɛma wɔayi no.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ara na sɛ moamfa mo nuanom mfomso ankyɛ wɔn a, me soro Agya nso remfa mo mfomso nkyɛ mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Awaregyae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu wiee nʼasɛnka no, ɔkɔɔ Galilea. Ofi Galilea no, otwaa Asubɔnten Yordan baa Yudea. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Nnipadɔm tu dii nʼakyi, ma ɔsaa wɔn yare.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Farisifo bi ba bebisaa no nsɛm bi pɛɛ sɛ wɔnam wɔn nsɛmmisa no so ma ɔka asɛm bi a ɛde no bɛkɔ sɔhwɛ mu. Wobisaa no se, “Wopene awaregyae so ana?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Gyama monkenkan Kyerɛw Kronkron no? Wɔakyerɛw wɔ mu se, ‘Mfiase no, Onyankopɔn bɔɔ ɔbarima ne ɔbea.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/><char style="wj">Eyi nti na ɔbarima begyaw nʼagya ne ne na hɔ de ne ho akɔbɔ ne yere ho daa nyinaa no.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/><char style="wj">Enti na wɔnyɛ baanu bio, na mmom wɔabɛyɛ ɔhonam koro. Enti nea Onyankopɔn aka abɔ mu no, ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara tetew mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Farisifo no kɔɔ so bisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na Mose kae se, sɛ ɔbarima bi pɛ sɛ ogyaa ne yere a otumi kyerɛw no krataa kɛkɛ, de gyaa no?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Esiane sɛ na mo koma apirim no nti na Mose maa awaregyae ho kwan, na ɛnyɛ ade a Onyankopɔn hyehyɛe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/><char style="wj">Na mereka akyerɛ mo se, obiara a obegyaa ne yere, a ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔbea no abɔ aguaman, na ɔbɛsan aware ɔbea foforo no asɛe aware.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Yesu asuafo no kae se, “Sɛ saa na ɛte de a, na ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara ware.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ obiara na obetumi agye asɛm yi ato mu, gye wɔn a Onyankopɔn hyɛ wɔn den no nko ara.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/><char style="wj">Nnipa bi wɔ hɔ a wonni mmarimayɛ mu ahoɔden fi awo mu, ebinom nso wɔ hɔ a nnipa na wɔyɛɛ wɔn saa; ebinom nso ɔsoro Ahenni no nti, wɔpo aware. Obiara a obetumi no, nni mʼasɛm a maka yi so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyira Mmofra Nkumaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Wɔde mmofra nkumaa brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔmfa ne nsa ngu wɔn so, na ɔmmɔ mpae mma wɔn. Nanso asuafo no kaa wɔn anim.<verse eid="MAT 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Momma mmofra no kwan na wɔmmra me nkyɛn, na munnsiw wɔn kwan, na eyinom sɛɛ na Ɔsoro Ahenni no yɛ wɔn dea.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Na ɔde ne nsa guu wɔn so, hyiraa wɔn ansa na ɔrefi hɔ akɔ.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahonya Ne Onyankopɔn Ahenni No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Ɛno mu na ɔbarima bi baa Yesu nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfo, ade pa bɛn na menyɛ na manya nkwa a enni awiei?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn nti na wubisa me nea ɛyɛ papa ho asɛm? Ɔbaako pɛ na ɔyɛ papa. Sɛ wopɛ sɛ wokɔ nkwa mu de a, di mmara nsɛm no so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Aberante no nso bisaa no se, “Mmaransɛm no mu nea ɛwɔ he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Nni awu. Nsɛe aware. Mmɔ korɔn. Nni atoro.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/><char style="wj">Di wʼagya ne wo na ni, na dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho!”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Aberante no nso kae se, “Midi eyinom nyinaa so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Afei menyɛ dɛn?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ wopɛ sɛ woyɛ pɛ a kɔ na kɔtɔn biribiara a wowɔ, na fa sika a wubenya afi mu no ma ahiafo. Ɛno ansa na wubenya ademude wɔ ɔsoro. Afei bedi mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Esiane sɛ na saa aberante yi wɔ ahonyade bebree nti, ɔtee saa nsɛm no, anyɛ no dɛ maa ɔde awerɛhow fii hɔ kɔe.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Afei Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Meka mo nokware se ɛyɛ den ma osikani sɛ ɔbɛkɔ Ɔsoro Ahenni no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/><char style="wj">Meka ti mu se, ɛyɛ mmerɛw sɛ yoma bewura pane aniwa mu sen sɛ osikani bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahenni mu!”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Asuafo no tee saa asɛm no, wɔn adwene mu yɛɛ wɔn naa. Wobisae se, “Na ɛno de, hena na wiase mu ha wobegye no nkwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu hwɛɛ wɔn buae se, <char style="wj">“Onipa fam de, ɛyɛ den, na Onyankopɔn fam de, biribiara betumi aba mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahopakyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Petro nso kae se, “Yagyaw biribiara hɔ abedi wʼakyi; na mfaso bɛn na yebenya afi wʼakyidi no mu?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu buae se, <char style="wj">“Me, Agyenkwa no, sɛ metena mʼanuonyam ahengua no so a, nokware, mo mʼasuafo yi nso bɛtena ahengua dumien no so na moabu Israel mmusuakuw dumien no atɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a obegyaw ne fi, ne nuabarimanom, ne nuabeanom, nʼagya, ne na, ne yere, ne mma anaa nʼagyapade abedi mʼakyi no, obenya no ho mmɔho ɔha, na wanya nkwa a enni awiei nso.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a wɔadi kan no mu pii bedi akyi, na wɔn a wodi akyi no nso mu bi abedi kan.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Afum Adwumayɛfo Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>Yesu san buu wɔn bɛ foforo bi se, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni te sɛ okuafo bi a ofii adi anɔpa bi sɛ ɔrekɔhwehwɛ nnipa abɔ wɔn paa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/><char style="wj">Ne nsa kaa apaafo no, ɔne wɔn hyehyɛɛ sɛ obetua wɔn da koro adwuma so akatua.</char><verse eid="MAT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ankyɛ ofii adi bio kohuu nnipa bi nso, sɛ wogyinagyina hɔ a wɔnyɛ hwee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/><char style="wj">Ɔfaa wɔn nso de wɔn kɔɔ nʼafuw no mu. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn nso se, obetua wɔn nea eye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/><char style="wj">Enti wɔkɔe.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsan kɔɔ owigyinae ne nnɔn abiɛsa bere mu kɔbɔɔ nnipa foforo paa ne wɔn yɛɛ nhyehyɛe koro no ara bi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/><char style="wj">Ɔsan fii adi bɛyɛ nnɔnnum bere mu, kohuu sɛ nnipa bi gyinagyina hɔ. Obisaa wɔn se, ‘Adɛn nti na da mu yi nyinaa mugyinagyina ha a monyɛ hwee?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wobuae se, ‘Obi mmɛbɔɔ yɛn paa ɛ.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">
    <char style="wj">“Ɛhɔ ara na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, ‘Ɛno de, mo nso monkɔyɛ adwuma wɔ mʼafum.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Eduu anwummere no, ɔfrɛɛ nea otua nʼapaafo no ka no ka kyerɛɛ no se, ‘Hwɛ na tua wɔn ka, fi wɔn a wɔbaa akyiri yi no so kosi wɔn a wɔbaa kan no so.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Apaafo a ɔfaa wɔn akyiri no nyinaa, otuaa wɔn da koro apaade.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔfaa wɔn kan no nso bae. Wosusuw sɛ wobenya sika a ɛboro wɔn a wɔfaa wɔn akyiri no de no. Nanso wɔn nso wotuaa wɔn sɛnea wotuaa wɔn a wɔbaa akyiri no ara pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/><char style="wj">Wɔn nsa kaa wɔn apaade no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/><char style="wj">Wɔka kyerɛɛ afuw wura no se, ‘Nnipa a wɔbaa akyiri no yɛɛ adwuma dɔnhwerew baako pɛ, nanso yɛn a yɛyɛɛ adwuma fi anɔpa maa owia hyee yɛn no, womaa yɛne wɔn nyinaa akatua pɛ.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obuaa wɔn mu baako se, ‘Damfo, menyɛɛ wo bɔne biara. Me ne wo anni ano sɛ, metua wo da koro adwuma so akatua ana?</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/><char style="wj">Fa sika a wo nsa aka no na kɔ. Efi me pɛ mu na meretua wɔn a wɔbaa kan ne wɔn a wɔbaa akyiri no nyinaa ka pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/><char style="wj">Mmara bi siw me ho kwan sɛ mede me sika yɛ nea mepɛ? Anaasɛ mʼayamye nti na wʼani abere yi?’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Asɛm a Yesu ka de wiee ne sɛ, ‘Saa ara na wɔn a wodi akyi no bedi kan, na wɔn a wodi kan no nso bedi akyi.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Wu Ho Nkɔm A Ɛto So Abiɛsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesu sii mu sɛ ɔrekɔ Yerusalem no, ɔde nʼasuafo no kaa ne ho. <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>Wɔrekɔ no, ɔtwee nʼasuafo no gyinaa nkyɛn baabi ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Yɛrekɔ Yerusalem. Wobeyi me ama asɔfo mpanyin ne kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo, na wɔabu me kumfɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/><char style="wj">Wɔde me bɛhyɛ Roma aban nsa, na wɔadi me ho fɛw, abɔ me asennua mu, na ne nnansa so no, mɛsɔre afi awufo mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛna Bi Adesrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Sebedeo mma Yakobo ne Yohane ne wɔn na baa Yesu nkyɛn. Ɔbea yi de adesrɛde bi bɛtoo Yesu anim.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn na wopɛ sɛ menyɛ mma wo?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Obuaa no se, “Mepɛ sɛ, sɛ wokɔ wʼahenni mu a, me mma baanu yi mu baako tena wo nifa so, na ɔbaako nso tena wo benkum so.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Nanso Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Wunnim nea worebisa no.”</char> Afei ɔdan ne ho bisaa Yakobo ne Yohane se, <char style="wj">“Mubetumi anom kuruwa a merebɛnom ano no bi ana?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wobuaa no se, “Yebetumi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Me kuruwa ano de, mubetumi anom, nanso minni tumi sɛ miyi wɔn a wɔbɛtena me nifa anaa me benkum so. Saa afa no wɔ hɔ ma wɔn a mʼAgya ayi wɔn no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Asuafo du a aka no tee nea Yakobo ne Yohane akobisa no, wɔn bo fuwii. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Yesu frɛɛ wɔn nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Munim sɛ ahene ne atumfo di wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn ase no so. Saa ara nso na wɔn a wodi wɔn so no nso di afoforo so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/><char style="wj">Nanso mo de, ɛnte saa wɔ mo mu. Mmom, obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔkɛse wɔ mo mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo somfo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ odikanfo wɔ mo mu no, ɔnyɛ mo akoa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no amma sɛ wɔnsom no, na mmom ɔbɛsomee, na ɔde ne kra too hɔ sɛ mpata maa nnipa nyinaa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anifuraefo Baanu Hu Ade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafo fi Yeriko rekɔ no, nnipadɔm tu dii wɔn akyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Wɔrekɔ no, wɔkɔfaa baabi a anifuraefo baanu bi tete. Anifuraefo yi tee sɛ Yesu retwa mu no, wɔteɛteɛɛ mu se, “Awurade, Dawid Ba, hu yɛn mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Nnipadɔm a wodi Yesu akyi no teɛteɛɛ wɔn se wommua wɔn ano. Nanso anifuraefo no kɔɔ so teɛteɛɛ mu se, “Awurade, Dawid Ba, hu yɛn mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu duu nea wɔtete hɔ no, ogyina bisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Dɛn na mopɛ sɛ meyɛ ma mo?”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Awurade, yɛpɛ sɛ yehu ade!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Anifuraefo no yɛɛ Yesu mmɔbɔ. Ɔde ne nsa kekaa wɔn ani, na prɛko pɛ wohuu ade, na wodii nʼakyi.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Yerusalem Sɛ Ɔhempɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Aka kakra na Yesu ne nʼasuafo no adu Yerusalem no, wɔbɛn kurow bi a wɔfrɛ no Betfage a ɛwɔ Ngo Bepɔw no so hɔ no. Ɛhɔ na Yesu somaa nʼasuafo no mu baanu se, wonni kan nkɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mudu hɔ a, mubehu sɛ wɔasa afurum bi ne ne ba hama. Monsan wɔn, na momfa wɔn mmrɛ me.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi ka asɛm bi kyerɛ mo a, monka nkyerɛ onipa ko no se, ‘Wɔn ho hia Awurade,’ na ntɛm ara ɔbɛma mo de wɔn aba.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Wɔyɛɛ eyi de hyɛɛ tete nkɔmhyɛ a ɛka se,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Monka nkyerɛ Ɔbabea Sion se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">wo hene reba wo nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Odwo, na ɔte afurum ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">afurum ba so” no mu den.<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Asuafo baanu no yɛɛ nea Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Wɔde mmoa no brɛɛ no no, wɔde wɔn ntama sesɛw afurum no so, maa Yesu tenaa no so. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Nnipadɔm a wɔwɔ hɔ no bi de wɔn ntama sesɛw ɔkwan a ɔde aboa no nam so no so. Ebinom nso bubuu nnua mman de sesɛw ɔkwan no mu saa ara. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Dɔm no tu teɛe de osebɔ teɛteɛɛ mu se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosiana Dawid Ba!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Nhyira ne nea ɔnam Awurade din mu reba no.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosiana wɔ ɔsoro nohɔ!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Bere a oduu Yerusalem no, kurow no nyinaa bɔɔ twi. Ɛhɔfo no bisae se, “Na hena ni?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Nnipadɔm no buae se, “Ɛyɛ Yesu, Odiyifo a ofi Nasaret a ɛwɔ Galileaman mu no.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Hyiadan Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu fii hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu. Oduu hɔ no, ɔpam aguadifo a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa, kaa sikasesafo apon nyinaa guu fam, bubuu pata a wɔtɔn mmorɔnoma wɔ mu no nyinaa gui. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Kyerɛwsɛm no ka se, ‘Mʼasɔrefi yɛ beae a wɔbɔ mpae.’ Nanso mo de, mode hɔ ayɛ adwowtwafo atenae.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Afei anifuraefo ne mmubuafo baa ne nkyɛn wɔ hyiadan mu hɔ ma ɔsaa wɔn nyinaa yare. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Nanso bere a asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin bi huu anwonwade yi na wɔtee nso sɛ mmofra nkumaa a wɔwɔ hyiadan mu hɔ reteɛteɛ mu se, “Nhyira nka Dawid Ba no” no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Enti wobisaa Yesu se, “Wote nsɛm a mmofra no reka no ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu bua se, <char style="wj">“Yiw. Na monkenkan saa Kyerɛwsɛm a ɛka se,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mmofra ne nkokoaa mpo</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="wj">de wɔn ano kamfo wo’ no da, ana?”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Afei ofii hɔ san kɔɔ Betania kɔdaa hɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Dome Borɔdɔma Dua Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Ade kyee anɔpa a ɔresan akɔ Yerusalem no, ɔkɔm dee no. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Ohuu sɛ borɔdɔma dua bi si ɔkwan ho baabi. Ɔkɔɔ hɔ kɔhwɛɛ sɛ borɔdɔma no bi wɔ so, nanso oduu hɔ no, ohuu sɛ nhaban nko ara na ɛwɔ so. Ɔdomee borɔdɔma dua no se, <char style="wj">“Efi nnɛ, worensow aba bio!”</char> Ɛhɔ ara borɔdɔma dua no wui.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Asɛm yi yɛɛ Yesu asuafo no nwonwa ma wobisaa no se, “Na ɛyɛɛ dɛn nti na borɔdɔma dua no so nhaban poo ntɛm saa?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu nso buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Nokware, sɛ mowɔ gyidi na munnhinhim a, mubetumi ayɛ ade koro yi ara bi, anaa nea ɛkyɛn saa mpo. Anka mubetumi aka akyerɛ Ngo Bepɔw yi se, ‘Tutu kogu po mu,’ na ebetutu akogu mu nso.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/><char style="wj">Biribiara a mode gyidi bebisa wɔ mpaebɔ mu no, mo nsa bɛka.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tumi Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu san kɔɔ hyiadan mu hɔ a ɔrekyerɛkyerɛ no, asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin baa ne kyɛn bebisaa no tumi ko a ogyina so pam aguadifo ne sikasesafo no fii hyiadan mu hɔ no.<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Merebebisa mo asɛm baako bi, na mummua me ansa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa Osuboni Yohane anaa ɛnyɛ ɔno?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Wodwinnwen ho kae se, “Sɛ yɛka sɛ ‘Efi Onyankopɔn’ a, wobebisa yɛn nea enti a yɛannye nea Yohane kae no anni? <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Na sɛ yɛka se, ‘Ɛnyɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔsomaa no’ nso a, dɔm no bɛhaw yɛn efisɛ, wɔn nyinaa nim sɛ Yohane yɛ odiyifo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Enti wɔn mmuae a wɔmae ara ne sɛ, “Yennim!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Ɛhɔ ara na Yesu nso kae se, <char style="wj">“Sɛ munnim de a, me nso meremmua mo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmabarima Baanu Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Yesu kae se, <char style="wj">“Saa asɛm a merebɛka yi mudwen ho dɛn? Ɔbarima bi wɔ mmabarima baanu. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn mu panyin no se, ‘Me ba, nnɛ kɔ mʼafum na kɔyɛ adwuma wɔ hɔ.’</char><verse eid="MAT 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne ba no kae se, ‘Merenkɔ,’ nanso akyiri no, ɔsesaa nʼadwene na ɔkɔe.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei agya no ka kyerɛɛ akumaa no se, ‘Wo nso kɔ.’ Ɔno nso kae se, ‘Agya, mate, mɛkɔ.’ Nanso wankɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa mmofra baanu yi mu hena na otie nʼagya asɛm?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wobuae se, “Ɛyɛ ne ba panyin no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesu see wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Akyinnye biara nni ho sɛ abɔnefo ne nguamanfo bɛkɔ Ɔsoro Ahenni mu ansa na moakɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/><char style="wj">Efisɛ Yohane baa mo nkyɛn sɛ ɔrebɛkyerɛ mo trenee kwan, na moannye no anni. Nanso towgyefo ne nguamanfo gyee no dii. Na muhuu eyi mpo no, moansakra mo adwene, na moannye no anni.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaafo Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Yesu buu wɔn bɛ foforo bi se, <char style="wj">“Da bi, ɔbarima bi a ɔwɔ bobeturo a wagye ban afa ho, na watu amoa a wokyi nsa wɔ mu, de afuw no gyaw akuafo bi. Eyi akyi no, otuu kwan kɔɔ ɔman foforo bi so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/><char style="wj">Eduu bere a bobe no beree a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtew no, ɔsomaa ne ho nnipa baa akuafo no hɔ sɛ wommegye ne kyɛfa mmrɛ no.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Woduu hɔ ara pɛ na akuafo no tow hyɛɛ nnipa no so, boroo ɔbaako, kum ɔbaako na wosiw ɔbaako nso abo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/><char style="wj">Afei ɔsan somaa nnipa a wɔn dodow sen wɔn a ɔsomaa wɔn kan no se wɔnkɔ akuafo no nkyɛn, nanso asɛm koro no ara bi na esii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/><char style="wj">Eyi akyi no ɔsomaa ɔno nʼankasa ne ba kɔɔ akuafo no nkyɛn susuwii sɛ, wɔde nidi bɛma no.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso akuafo no huu sɛ ne ba no apue reba pɛ, wɔfaa ne ho adwene kae se, ‘Ɔdedifo no na ɔreba no; momma yenkum no, na yɛmfa afuw no!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/><char style="wj">Ɛhɔ ara na wɔtwee no fii afuw no mu, kokum no too baabi.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ afuw wura no san ba a, mugye di sɛ dɛn na ɔbɛyɛ saa akuafo no?”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Yudafo mpanyin no buae se, “Ɔno nso bekum saa atirimɔdenfo no na ɔde afuw no ama akuafo foforo a wɔde ne kyɛfa bɛma no bere a ɛsɛ mu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn bio se, <char style="wj">“Monkenkan Kyerɛwsɛm no mu da sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɔbo a adansifo apo no</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">ɛno ara na abɛyɛ ɔdan no twea so tibo.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">Awurade na wayɛ eyi,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">na ɛyɛ nwonwa wɔ yɛn ani so?’</char><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nea mereka ara ne sɛ, wobegye Onyankopɔn Ahenni no afi mo nsam de akɔma ɔman foforo a wobebu ne nnɔbae no ho nkontaa pa akyerɛ no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔbɛhwe saa ɔbotan yi so no mu bebubu, na nea ɔbo no bɛhwe ne so no nso bɛpɛtɛw.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Bere a asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin no tee ase sɛ Yesu asɛm a ɔreka no fa wɔn ho no, <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔyɛ no bɔne, nanso na wosuro dɔm no efisɛ na wɔagye Yesu ato mu sɛ ɔyɛ Odiyifo.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayeforohyia Aponto Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu de mmebu ahorow kyerɛɛ sɛnea Ɔsoro Ahenni no te. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>Ose, <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni no te sɛ ɔhene bi a ne babarima hyiaa ayeforo na ɔtoo pon maa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/><char style="wj">Ɔtoo nsa frɛɛ nnipa pii. Bere no dui no, ɔnam tumi so somaa nʼasomfo sɛ wɔnkɔfrɛfrɛ nnipa no na wɔmmra. Nanso nnipa no amma.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsan somaa nʼasomfo afoforo se, ‘Monkɔka nkyerɛ wɔn se, wɔawie biribiara. Wɔakum mʼanantwi ne me nyɛmmoa de anoa aduan awie. Mommra ayeforo no ase mmedidi!’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso wɔammua no. Obi kɔɔ nʼafum. Ɔfoforo nso kodii ne gua.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/><char style="wj">Afoforo nso kyeree nʼasomfo no hwee wɔn, pirapiraa wɔn, kunkum ebinom nso.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/><char style="wj">Ɔhene no tee nea nnipa no ayɛ nʼasomfo no, ne bo fuwii. Ɔsomaa nʼasraafo ma wokokunkum awudifo no, hyew wɔn kurow no pasaa.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsan frɛɛ nʼasomfo ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, ‘Wɔawie ayeforo aduan no. Nanso wɔn a mefrɛɛ wɔn no mfata sɛ wɔba aponto no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/><char style="wj">Enti monkɔ mmɔnten so na obiara a mubehu no no, momfrɛ no mmra aponto no ase.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/><char style="wj">Asomfo no fii adi kɔɔ mmɔnten so kɔfrɛɛ nnipa dodow a wohuu wɔn no nyinaa. Wɔfrɛɛ nnipa pa ne nnipa bɔne, maa ɔdan a wɔtoo pon wɔ mu no yɛɛ ma.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔhene no baa hɔ sɛ ɔrebɛhwɛ nnipa a wɔaba no, ohuu obi a ɔnhyɛ ayeforohyia atade wɔ hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/><char style="wj">Obisaa no se, ‘Damfo, ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wonhyɛ ayeforohyia atade, na wutumi baa ha?’ Nanso damfo no antumi ammua.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfo no se, ‘Monkyekyere ne nan ne ne nsa na monkɔtow no nkyene akyirikyiri sum mu, nea osu ne setwɛre wɔ no.’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔafrɛ bebree, nanso kakraa bi na wɔpaw wɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Towyi Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Farisifo no tuu Yesu ho agyina, pɛɛ ɔkwan bi a wɔbɛfa nʼanom asɛm so anya no akyere no. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Wosii no gyinae se, wɔbɛsoma wɔn nnipa bi ne Herodefo aba Yesu nkyɛn abebisa no se, “Owura, yenim sɛ woyɛ ɔnokwafo, na wonam nokware kwan so kyerɛ nnipa kwan a ɛkɔ Onyankopɔn nkyɛn a wunsuro akyi asɛm, efisɛ wonhwɛ nnipa anim. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Ka ma yentie. Eye sɛ woyi tow ma Roma Hempɔn Kaesare anaa enye?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Yesu huu wɔn adwemmɔne no ma ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo nyaatwomfo! Adɛn nti na mopɛ sɛ mode nnaadaa sɔ me hwɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/><char style="wj">Momfa sika a wɔde yi tow no bi nkyerɛ me.”</char> Wɔde bi kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Obisaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Hena mfoni na ɛda so, na hena din nso na ɛwɔ so?”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Wobuaa se, “Kaesare.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Ɛno de, momfa Kaesare de mma Kaesare, na momfa Onyankopɔn de mma Onyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Ne mmuae a ɔmaa wɔn no maa wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn ma wogyaw no hɔ kɔe.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔre Mu Aware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Da no ara, Sadukifo a wonnye owusɔre nni no baa Yesu nkyɛn bebisaa no se, <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>“Owura, Mose kae se, ‘Sɛ ɔbarima bi anwo na owu a, ne nuabarima mfa ne yere no kunabea na ɔne no nwo mma owufo no. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Anuanom baason bi ne yɛn tenaa ha. Ɔpanyin no waree a wanwo ba na owui. Enti ne nua a ɔto so abien no faa ne yere no kunabea. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Nea ɔto so abien no nso wui, maa nea ɔto so abiɛsa no faa ɔbea no kunabea. Ɔno nso wui a wanwo ba, maa ɔfoforo nso faa ɔbea no kunabea. Eyi toaa so ara kosii sɛ anuanom baason no nyinaa waree ɔbea no. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Nea edi akyi ne sɛ, ɔbea no nso wui. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Ɛno nti, owusɔrebere no, nnipa baason yi mu hena na ɔbea no bɛyɛ ne yere? Efisɛ wɔn nyinaa waree no!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu buaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Mo mfomso a moayɛ no fi nim a munnim Kyerɛwsɛm no ne Onyankopɔn tumi a ɔwɔ no!</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/><char style="wj">Na owusɔrebere no, aware nni hɔ; obiara bɛyɛ sɛ abɔfo a wɔwɔ ɔsoro no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/><char style="wj">Nea ɛfa owusɔre no ho no nso, monkenkan nea Onyankopɔn aka afa ho no pɛn? Munhu sɛ Onyankopɔn kasa kyerɛɛ mo bere a ɔkae se,</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/><char style="wj">‘Mene Abraham Nyankopɔn, Isak Nyankopɔn ne Yakob Nyankopɔn no?’ Eyi kyerɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn nyɛ awufo Nyankopɔn na mmom, ateasefo Nyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Nnipadɔm no tee ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no, ɛyɛɛ wɔn nwonwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmaransɛm No Mu Nea Ɛkyɛn Ne Nyinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Farisifo no tee sɛ Yesu abu afa Sadukifo no so no, wokohyiaa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Wɔn mu baako a ɔyɛ mmaranimfo bisaa Yesu se, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Owura, Mose mmaransɛm no mu nea ɛwɔ he koraa na ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“ ‘Dɔ Awurade, wo Nyankopɔn, wo koma nyinaa mu ne wo kra nyinaa mu ne wʼadwene nyinaa mu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/><char style="wj">Eyi ne mmaransɛm no mu nea edi kan na ɛkyɛn ne nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/><char style="wj">Nea ɛto so abien no te sɛ ɛno ara: ‘Dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/><char style="wj">Mose mmaransɛm ne adiyifo no nkyerɛkyerɛ no nyinaa gyina saa mmaransɛm abien yi so.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hena Ba Ne Agyenkwa No?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Farisifo no twaa Yesu ho hyiae no, obisaa wɔn se, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Dɛn na mususuw fa Agyenkwa no ho? Hena ba ne no?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wobuaa no se, “Dawid Ba.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn se <char style="wj">“Ɛno de, adɛn na Dawid nam Honhom Kronkron so frɛ no ‘Awurade?’ Efisɛ Dawid kae se,</char><verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me wura se,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">“Tena me nifa</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">kosi sɛ mɛma woadi</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">wʼatamfo nyinaa so.” ’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Sɛ <char style="wj">Dawid frɛ no ‘Awurade’ a, ɛno de, ɛyɛɛ dɛn na Kristo no yɛ ne ba?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Obiara antumi ammua. Eyi akyi nso, obiara antumi ammisa no nsɛm bio.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyaatwomyɛ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipadɔm no ne nʼasuafo no se, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/><char style="wj">“Kyerɛwsɛm no Akyerɛkyerɛfo ne Farisifo no na wɔkyerɛ Mose mmara no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/><char style="wj">Eyi nti, ɛsɛ sɛ mutie wɔn, na moyɛ biribiara a wɔkyerɛ mo. Nanso monnyɛ nea wɔyɛ no bi efisɛ nea wɔka no, ɛnyɛ ɛno na wɔyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/><char style="wj">Wɔhyɛ mo ma mudi mmara a ɛyɛ den so a wɔn ankasa mpɛ sɛ wodi so.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Biribiara a wɔyɛ no yɛ ɔyɛkyerɛ. Wɔde sɛbɛ a kyerɛw nsɛm bi hyɛ mu sɛn wɔn nsa, hyɛ ntade yuu kyerɛ sɛ wɔyɛ atreneefo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/><char style="wj">Na wɔkɔ aponto ase nso a, wɔpɛ sɛ daa wɔtena mpanyin tenabea; wɔkɔ asɔre nso a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔtena mpanyin tenabea pa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wode obu kyia wɔn wɔ abɔnten so na wofrɛ wɔn ‘Rabi’ anaa ‘Owura’ a ɛyɛ wɔn dɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommma obiara mmfrɛ mo sa. Efisɛ Onyankopɔn nko ara na ɔyɛ Owura. Mo nyinaa moyɛ pɛ sɛ anuanom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/><char style="wj">Mommfrɛ obiara wɔ asase so ha sɛ ‘Agya,’ efisɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔfrɛ no saa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/><char style="wj">Na mommma wɔmmfrɛ mo ‘Owura,’ efisɛ ɔbaako pɛ na ɔyɛ mo wura a ɔne Agyenkwa no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/><char style="wj">Wobrɛ wo ho ase som afoforo a, wobɛyɛ ɔkɛse. Wopɛ sɛ woyɛ ɔkɛse a, yɛ ɔsomfo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbɛma ne ho so no, wɔbɛbrɛ no ase; saa ara nso na obiara a ɔbɛbrɛ ne ho ase no, wɔbɛma no so.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kasa Tia Nyaatwomyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Mo Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo nyaatwomfo, efisɛ musiw afoforo Ɔsoro Ahenni ho kwan. Mo a, monkɔ mu. Mo nso a, momma afoforo a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkɔ mu no kwan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/><char style="wj">Nyaatwomfo! Mobɔ mpae atenten wɔ mmɔnten so de kyerɛ sɛ moyɛ atreneefo wɔ bere a mutu akunafo fi wɔn afi mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Mo Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo nyaatwomfo! Mokɔ wiase afanan nyinaa sɛ mubenya onipa baako abɛfra mo mu. Na sɛ munya obi saa a, mosɛe no ma ɔyɛ ɔbonsam ba sen sɛnea mote no.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Akwankyerɛfo anifuraefo a moka se, sɛ obi de asɔredan ka ntam a, ɛno de, ɛnyɛ hwee. Na sɛ ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ a ɛwɔ asɔredan no mu ka ntam de a, ɛno de, ntam no kyekyere onii no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/><char style="wj">Anifuraefo nkwaseafo! Asɔredan no ne emu sikakɔkɔɔ no mu nea ɛwɔ he na ɛsom bo; sikakɔkɔɔ no anaa asɔredan no a ɛtew sikakɔkɔɔ no ho no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/><char style="wj">Na moka se, ‘Sɛ obi ka afɔremuka no ntam a, ɛnyɛ hwee. Na mmom, sɛ ɔka ayɛyɛde a egu afɔremuka no so ntam de a, ɛkyekye onii! no’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/><char style="wj">Anifuraefo! Afɔremuka a ɛtew ayɛyɛde a egu so no ho no, ne ayɛyɛde a egu so no mu nea ɛwɔ he na ɛsom bo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woka afɔremuka no ntam a, woka afɔremuka no ne ɛso ayɛyɛde no nyinaa ntam,</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/><char style="wj">na sɛ woka asɔredan no ntam a, woka asɔredan no ne Onyankopɔn a ɔte mu no nyinaa ntam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ woka ɔsoro ntam a, na woreka Onyankopɔn ahengua ne Onyankopɔn no ankasa ntam.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Mo Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo nyaatwomfo! Muyi ntotoso du du wɔ afifide a ɛwɔ mo mfikyifuw mu no ho, nanso mugyaw nneɛma a ɛsom bo te sɛ atɛntrenee, ahummɔbɔ ne nokwaredi. Ɛwɔ mu sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ muyiyi ntotoso du du no de, nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mugyaw nneɛma a ɛsom bo no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/><char style="wj">Akwankyerɛfo anifuraefo! Mosɔn nea monom so, yi mu nwansena nanso momene yoma!</char><verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Mo Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo nyaatwomfo! Mutwiw mo kuruwa ne mo asanka ho fɛfɛɛfɛ nanso emu no de, amim ne pɛsɛmenkominya ahyɛ no ma tɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/><char style="wj">Farisifo anifuraefo! Muntwiw kuruwa no mu kan, na kuruwa no ho nyinaa bɛtew!</char><verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Mo Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo! Mote sɛ ɔda a wɔasra ho fɛfɛɛfɛ nanso awufo nnompe ne nneɛma funu ahyɛ mu ma tɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/><char style="wj">Moyɛ mo anim sɛ atreneefo, nanso bɔne ahorow ahyɛ mo mu ma tɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Munnue! Mo Farisifo ne Kyerɛwsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfo nyaatwomfo! Musisi ada akɛse ma adiyifo a mo ara mo agyanom kunkum wɔn, na mode nhwiren gugu atreneefo a wokunkum wɔn no nna so,</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/><char style="wj">na mutwa mo ho ka se, ‘Sɛ na yɛte ase saa bere no a, anka yɛrenyɛ bɔne a yɛn agyanom yɛe no.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moka saa a, mubu mo ho fɔ sɛ moyɛ atirimɔdenfo mma.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/><char style="wj">Munni wɔn anammɔn akyi nyɛ saa bɔne koro no ara bi pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Awɔ! Nhurutoa mma! Mobɛyɛ dɛn aguan amanehunu gya mu atemmu no?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/><char style="wj">Mɛsoma adiyifo ne anyansafo ne akyerɛkyerɛfo aba mo nkyɛn. Mobɛbɔ wɔn mu bi asennua mu akum wɔn. Mobɛbɔ ebinom akyi mmaa wɔ mo asɔredan mu, na moataa bi afi nkurow so akɔ nkurow so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/><char style="wj">Na atreneefo mogya a moahwie agu asase so nyinaa, efi Habel so de kosi Barakia ba Sakaria a mukum no asɔredan ne afɔremuka ntam no, bɛba mo so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo se, atemmu a wɔaboaboa ano no nyinaa bɛba nnɛmma yi so.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ao Yerusalem, Yerusalem, wo a wukum adiyifo, na wusiw wɔn a wɔasoma wɔn wo nkyɛn abo, mpɛn ahe na anka mepɛɛ sɛ meboaboa wo mma ano, sɛnea akokɔbeatan boaboa ne mma ano wɔ ne ntaban ase, nanso moampɛ!</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/><char style="wj">Wobegyaw mo fi ofituw ama mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/><char style="wj">Na mise mo sɛ, efi sesɛɛ morenhu me bio kosi sɛ mobɛka se, ‘Nhyira ne nea ɔnam Awurade din mu reba no.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔredansɛe Ho Nkɔmhyɛ Ne Awiei Mmere Nsɛnkyerɛnne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu refi faako a asɔredan no si hɔ akɔ no, nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn pɛɛ sɛ wɔtwe nʼadwene kɔ adan ahorow a ɛwɔ asɔredan no mu no so. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Nanso ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Wobedwiriw saa dan yi agu pasaa!”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhaw Ne Ɔtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesu kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔw no so. Ɔte hɔ no, nʼasuafo no baa ne nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Bere bɛn na nea woreka yi bɛba? Na nsɛnkyerɛnne bɛn na ɛbɛma yɛahu wo ba a wobɛsan aba bio no ne wiase awiei a ɛbɛba no?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ na obi annaadaa mo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/><char style="wj">Nnipa bebree de me din bɛba abɛka se, wɔne Agyenkwa no, na wɔadaadaa mo mu pii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mote sɛ wɔafi akodi ase a, ɛnkyerɛ me ba a mɛsan aba no ho nsɛnkyerɛnne. Ɛsɛ sɛ eyinom ba, nanso awiei no de, ennya mmae.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/><char style="wj">Aman bɛsɔre wɔ aman so, na ahenni asɔre wɔ ahenni so, na ɔkɔm ne asasewosow bɛba mmeaemmeae.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/><char style="wj">Eyinom nyinaa bɛyɛ nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu a ɛbɛba no mfiase.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ moyɛ me de nti, wɔbɛyɛ mo ayayade, na wɔakunkum mo wɔ wiase afanan nyinaa,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/><char style="wj">na mo mu pii bɛsan akɔ bɔne mu, na moayiyi mo ho mo ho ama, na moatentan mo ho mo ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/><char style="wj">Atoro adiyifo bebree bɛsɔre, na wɔadaadaa mo mu pii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/><char style="wj">Bɔne bɛdɔɔso wɔ wiase, na abrɛ nnipa dɔ a wɔwɔ no ase.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/><char style="wj">Nanso wɔn a wobegyina pintinn akodu awiei no, wobegye wɔn nkwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/><char style="wj">Na wɔbɛka asɛmpa a ɛfa Ahenni no ho no wɔ wiase mmaa nyinaa, na wɔate. Ɛno akyi ansa na awiei no bɛba.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahohia A Ɛyɛ Hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti sɛ muhu ‘abusude a ɛde ɔsɛe ba’ a Odiyifo Daniel kaa ho asɛm sɛ egyina kronkronbea hɔ no a, ma nea ɔkenkan no nte ase,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/><char style="wj">na wɔn a wɔte Yudea no nguan nkɔ Yuda mmepɔw so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/><char style="wj">Mma obiara a ɔwɔ ne fi dan atifi no nsian nkɔfa biribiara mfi ne fi hɔ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔwɔ mfuw so no nso nnsan wɔn akyi mmɛfa wɔn ntama.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/><char style="wj">Ɛbɛyɛ hu ama wɔn a wɔafa afuru ne wɔn a woturu mma saa bere no mu!</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/><char style="wj">Na mommɔ mpae na bere a ɛsɛ sɛ muguan no anyɛ awɔwbere anaa Homeda.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/><char style="wj">Efisɛ awerɛhowdi a ɛbɛba no, bi nsii wɔ wiase abakɔsɛm mu da, na bi nso rensi da.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nokware, sɛ wɔantwa saa nna no so a, ɛrenka obi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo se, ‘Agyenkwa no wɔ ha anaasɛ ɔwɔ nohɔ anaa wayi ne ho adi wɔ ha anaa ɛhɔ’ a, munnnye nni.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/><char style="wj">Atoro agyenkwanom ne atoro adiyifo bɛsɔre, na wɔayɛ anwonwade ahorow na sɛ ebetumi a, wɔadaadaa wɔn a Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn no mpo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ yiye, efisɛ maka biribiara akyerɛ mo!</char><verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti sɛ obi ka kyerɛ mo se, ‘Agyenkwa no asan aba na ɔwɔ sare so a,’ monnhaw mo ho sɛ mobɛkɔ hɔ akɔhwehwɛ no. Anaasɛ nso wose, ‘Ɔde ne ho asie baabi a,’ munnnye nni!</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/><char style="wj">Na sɛnea anyinam twa fi apuei kɔ atɔe no, saa ara na sɛ Onipa Ba no reba a, ɛbɛyɛ ne no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/><char style="wj">Na nea funu wɔ no, ɛhɔ na apete bɛboaboa wɔn ho ano.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa mmere no awerɛhowdi no akyi pɛ</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘owia beduru sum,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">na ɔsram renhyerɛn;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">na nsoromma befi wim atetew ahwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="wj">na wim abɔde behinhim.’</char><verse eid="MAT 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei Onipa Ba no ho nsɛnkyerɛnne bɛda adi wɔ ɔsoro. Na asase sofo nyinaa betwa agyaadwo bere a wobehu Onipa Ba no sɛ ɔde tumi ne anuonyam nam ɔsoro omununkum mu reba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/><char style="wj">Na mɛsoma mʼabɔfo na wɔde torobɛnto a ano yɛ den aba abɛboaboa wɔn a mayi wɔn no ano fi ɔsoro ano akɔka asase ano.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei munsua biribi mfi borɔdɔma dua no ho asɛm no mu. Sɛ eyi mman foforo, san yi nhaban foforo a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ asusow abɛn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ muhu sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa afi ase resisi a, mubehu sɛ me ba a mɛsan aba no abɛn, adu ɔpon ano.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/><char style="wj">Nokware mise mo sɛ, awo ntoatoaso yi rentwa mu, gye sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa aba mu ansa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/><char style="wj">Ɔsoro ne asase betwa mu akɔ, nanso me nsɛm de, ɛbɛtena hɔ daa.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso da anaa dɔn ko a awiei no bɛba de, obiara nnim. Ɔsoro abɔfo ne Onyankopɔn Ba no mpo nnim. Agya no nko na onim.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no ba a ɔbɛba no bɛyɛ sɛnea Noa bere so ɛyɛɛ no ara pɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/><char style="wj">Na sɛnea nna a edi nsuyiri no anim no nnipa didii, na wɔnomee, warewaree, de kosii da a Noa kɔɔ hyɛn no mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/><char style="wj">na nnipa annye nea ɛbɛba anni, kosii sɛ nsuyiri bɛfaa wɔn nyinaa kɔe no, saa ara na me ba a mɛsan aba no bɛyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/><char style="wj">Saa bere no, wɔbɛfa mmarima baanu a wɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ afum no mu baako akɔ, na wɔagyaw ɔbaako.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na mmea baanu a wɔwɔ fie renoa aduan no nso, wɔbɛfa ɔbaako agyaw ɔbaako.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti monwɛn, efisɛ munnim da ko a Awurade bɛba.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/><char style="wj">Sɛnea sɛ ofiwura nim bere a owifo bɛba a anka ɔbɛwɛn de abɔ ne ho ban afi akorɔmfo ho no,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/><char style="wj">saa ara na ɛsɛ sɛ musiesie mo ho, efisɛ Onipa Ba no bɛba bere a mo ani nna so sɛ ɔbɛba.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akoa Pa Anaa Akoa Bɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Hena ne ɔsomfo nokwafo nyansafo no, nea ne wura de ne fi mu asomfo ahyɛ ne nsa sɛ ɔmma wɔn aduan wɔ bere a ɛsɛ mu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/><char style="wj">Nhyira ne ɔsomfo a ne wura no bɛba abɛto no sɛ wayɛ nʼadwuma pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/><char style="wj">Meka mo nokware se ɔde nea ɔwɔ nyinaa bɛhyɛ ne nsa na wahwɛ so!</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔkɔyɛ ɔsomfo tirimuɔdenfo, na ɔka kyerɛ ne ho se, ‘Me Wura nnya mmae,’</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/><char style="wj">na ofi ase boro ne mfɛfo nkoa, na ɔne akɔwensafo didi, bow nsa a,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/><char style="wj">Ɔsomfo no wura no bɛba da a nʼani nna so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/><char style="wj">Ɔbɛtwe nʼaso dennen, na ɔde no akɔ baabi a wobu nyaatwomfo atɛn; ɛhɔ na osu ne setwɛre wɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmabaa Du No Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsoro Ahenni te sɛ mmabaa du bi a wɔfaa wɔn akanea se wɔrekohyia ayeforokunu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/><char style="wj">Na mmabaa no mu baanum yɛ anyansafo na baanum nso yɛ nkwaseafo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/><char style="wj">Wɔn mu nkwaseafo no rekɔ no, wɔfaa wɔn akanea nanso wɔamfa ngo anka ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/><char style="wj">Nanso wɔn mu anyansafo no de, wɔrekɔ no wɔfaa ngo kaa wɔn akanea ho kɔe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/><char style="wj">Ayeforokunu no amma ntɛm, enti wofii ase totɔɔ nko dedae.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔdasu mu na wɔtee nteɛteɛmu se, ‘Ayeforokunu no reba! Mumfi adi nkohyia no!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mmabaa yi nyinaa sɔre buebuee wɔn akanea no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/><char style="wj">Nkwaseafo no srɛɛ anyansafo no se, ‘Momma yɛn mo ngo no bi ngu yɛn akanea no mu na ɛredunnum.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anyansafo no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, ‘Ngo a yɛwɔ no sua. Monkɔ kurom nkɔtɔ bi.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔrekɔ akɔtɔ ngo no pɛ, na ayeforokunu no bae. Enti wɔn a wɔasiesie wɔn ho no ne ayeforokunu no kɔɔ nʼaponto no ase, na wɔtoo ɔpon no mu.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akyiri no a baanum no san bae no, wogyinaa ɔpon no akyi frɛe se, ‘Owura, hiɛ yɛn!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, ‘Mumfi hɔ nkɔ. Minnim mo!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti monwɛn na munnim da anaa dɔn ko no.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sika Nkotoku No Ho Bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bio, Ɔsoro Ahenni te sɛ ɔbarima bi a ɔretu kwan akɔ ɔman foforo bi so. Ɔrekɔ no, ɔfrɛɛ ne nkoa na ɔde nʼahode maa wɔn.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/><char style="wj">Ɔmaa ɔbaako sika nkotoku anum. Ɔmaa ɔfoforo nkotoku abien na ɔfoforo, kotoku baako, sɛnea obiara ahoɔden te.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/><char style="wj">Nea ɔmaa no nkotoku anum no de sika no kɔyɛɛ adwuma, nyaa mfaso nkotoku anum kaa ho.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/><char style="wj">Saa ara na nea onyaa sika nkotoku abien no nso nyaa abien kaa ho,</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/><char style="wj">Nanso nea onyaa kotoku baako no de, okotuu fam de ne wura sika no siee hɔ.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mmere bi akyi na wɔn wura no fi akwantu mu bae ne wɔn bebuu akontaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/><char style="wj">Nea onyaa sika nkotoku anum no de anum kaa ho bae. Ɔkae se, ‘Me wura, womaa me sika nkotoku anum. Hwɛ, manya anum aka ho.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no ka kyerɛɛ no se, ‘Mo, akoa pa ne ɔnokwafo, woadi kakra yi ho nokware, mede wo besi nneɛma pii so panyin. Bra, na me ne wo nni dɛw!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akoa a ɔmaa no sika nkotoku abien no nso bae. Ɔka kyerɛɛ ne wura no se, ‘Worekɔ no, womaa me sika nkotoku abien, hwɛ, manya abien aka ho.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no ka kyerɛɛ no se, ‘Mo, akoa pa ne ɔnokwafo, woadi kakra yi ho nokware, mede wo besi nneɛma pii so panyin. Bra, wo wura anigye mu!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Akoa a onyaa sika kotoku baako no nso bae. Ɔka kyerɛɛ ne wura no se, ‘Owura, minim sɛ woyɛ onipa a wo ho yɛ nwonwa. Wutumi twa wɔ nea wunnuae ɛ, na wutumi boaboa ano wɔ nea wompetee ɛ;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/><char style="wj">enti misuroi, na mede wo sika no kɔhyɛɛ fam, enti wʼade ni!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no ka kyerɛɛ no se, ‘Akoa bɔne ne onihawfo! So wunim sɛ mitumi twa wɔ nea minnuae, na mitumi boaboa ano wɔ nea mempetee?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/><char style="wj">Saa de a anka ɛsɛ sɛ wode sika no kɔto sikakorabea nya nsiho to hɔ ma me.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Munnye sika kotoku no mfi ne nsam, na momfa nkɔma nea onyaa nkotoku du no.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔwɔ no, wɔde bi bɛka ho ama no anya aboro so. Na obiara a onni no, nea ɔwɔ no mpo, wobegye afi ne nsam.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/><char style="wj">Na wɔatow saa akoa a ne so nni mfaso no akyene sum kabii mu; ɛhɔ na osu ne setwɛre wɔ.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nguanten Ne Mmirekyi No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ Onipa Ba no ba nʼanuonyam mu a abɔfo nyinaa ka ne ho a, saa bere no na ɔbɛtena nʼanuonyam ahengua no so.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/><char style="wj">Na wɔbɛboaboa aman nyinaa ano wɔ nʼanim. Na ɔbɛpaw nnipa no mu sɛnea oguanhwɛfo paw nguan fi mmirekyi mu;</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/><char style="wj">na ɔde nguan no begyina ne nifa so, na ɔde mmirekyi no agyina ne benkum so.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛno na Ɔhene no bɛka akyerɛ wɔn a wogyina ne nifa so no se, ‘Mo a mʼagya ahyira mo, mommra mmɛfa ahenni a wɔasiesie ama mo fi abɔde mfiase no nni!</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/><char style="wj">Ɔkɔm dee me, na momaa me aduan dii. Osukɔm dee me, na momaa me nsu nomee. Meyɛɛ ɔhɔho, na mode me kɔɔ mo fi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/><char style="wj">Medaa adagyaw na mufuraa me ntama. Meyaree, na mobɛsraa me. Medaa afiase, na mobɛhwɛɛ me.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa bere no mu na atreneefo bebisa se, ‘Owura, da bɛn na yehuu wo sɛ ɔkɔm de wo a, yɛmaa wo aduan, na osukɔm de wo a yɛmaa wo nsu nomee?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/><char style="wj">Afei da bɛn na yehuu sɛ woyɛɛ ɔhɔho, a yɛde wo kɔɔ yɛn fi, anaasɛ wodaa adagyaw a, yefuraa wo ntama?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/><char style="wj">Afei da bɛn na yehuu sɛ woyaree a, yɛbɛsraa wo, anaasɛ wodaa afiase a, yɛbɛhwɛɛ wo?’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na Ɔhene no, bebua wɔn se, ‘Sɛ moayɛ ama me nuanom nkumaa yi mu baako yi, moayɛ ama me!’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei mɛka akyerɛ wɔn a wogyina me benkum so no se, ‘Mo a wɔadome mo, mumfi me so nkɔ ogyatannaa a ennum da a wɔasɔ ama ɔbonsam ne nʼabɔfo no mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/><char style="wj">Na ɔkɔm dee me, moamma me aduan anni, osukɔm dee me, moamma me nsu annom.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/><char style="wj">Meyɛɛ ɔhɔho, moamfa me ankɔ mo fi. Medaa adagyaw, moamfura me ntama. Meyaree, moammɛsra me. Medaa afiase, moammɛhwɛ me.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“Wɔn nso bebua no se, ‘Awurade, da bɛn na yehuu wo sɛ ɔkɔm dee wo, anaasɛ osukɔm dee wo, anaasɛ woyɛɛ ɔhɔho, anaasɛ wodaa adagyaw, anaasɛ woyaree, anaasɛ wodaa afiase, na yɛammoa wo?’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na obebua wɔn se, ‘Sɛ moanyɛ amma nkumaa yi mu baako nti, moanyɛ amma me.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na wɔbɛkɔ asotwe a ɛto ntwa da mu, na atreneefo akɔ nkwa a enni awiei mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Ho Pɔw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu wiee nsɛm yi nyinaa ka no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/><char style="wj">“Sɛnea munim no aka nnaanu na Twam Afahyɛ no adu, na wobeyi Onipa Ba no ama, na wɔabɔ no asennua mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Saa bere no ara na asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin bi ahyia mu wɔ Ɔsɔfopanyin Kaiafa fi, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>retu agyina ahwehwɛ ɔkwan a wɔbɛfa so akyere Yesu, akum no a obiara renhu akyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Nanso wɔkae se, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔkyere no Twam Afahyɛ no mu, anyɛ saa a, ɛde basabasayɛ bɛba ɔman no mu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsra Yesu Ngo Wɔ Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Afei Yesu kɔɔ Betania na ɔkɔɔ Simon ɔkwatani fi. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Ɔwɔ hɔ redidi no, ɔbea bi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maria a ɔyɛ Marta ne Lasaro nuabea (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh 12.3</ref></char>)</char></note> a okura ngo huamhuam bi a ne bo yɛ den yiye toa ma baa hɔ, behwie guu Yesu tirim.<verse eid="MAT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Asuafo no hui no, anyɛ wɔn dɛ. Wɔkae se, “Adesɛe yi ase ne dɛn? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Anka wobetumi atɔn srade huamhuam yi anya sika bebree de ama ahiafo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesu huu wɔn adwene na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na mohaw ɔbea yi? Wayɛ ade pa ama me.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/><char style="wj">Mo ne ahiafo wɔ ha daa na me de, me ne mo nni hɔ daa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/><char style="wj">Wahwie ngo huamhuam yi agu me so de asiesie me nipadua ama me sie.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/><char style="wj">Nokware, mise mo sɛ, wɔbɛka nea ɔyɛe yi wɔ wiase baabiara a wɔka asɛmpa no de akae no.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Pene So Sɛ Obeyi Yesu Ama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Afei Yuda Iskariot a ɔyɛ asuafo dumien no mu baako kɔɔ asɔfo mpanyin no nkyɛn <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>kobisaa wɔn se, “Sɛ miyi Yesu ma mo a, ahe na mode bɛma me?” Wɔmaa no dwetɛ mpɔw aduasa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Efi saa bere no, Yuda hwehwɛɛ ɔkwan a ɔbɛfa so ayi no ama wɔn.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidi A Edi Akyiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Apiti Afahyɛ da a edi kan no, asuafo no baa Yesu nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Ɛhe na wopɛ sɛ yekodi Twam Afahyɛ no?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Obuaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Monkɔ kurow no mu nkohu ɔpanyin asiamasi nka nkyerɛ no se, ‘Kyerɛkyerɛfo no se, Me bere abɛn, na wo fi na me ne nʼasuafo no bedi Twam Afahyɛ no.’ ”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Asuafo no dii nea ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn no so, yɛɛ Twam Afahyɛ aduan no.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Anwummere no na ɔne Dumien no te adidii. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Wɔredidi no ɔkae se, <char style="wj">“Mereka mo nokware, mo mu baako beyi me ama.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Asɛm yi maa wɔn werɛ howee yiye, na wofii ase bisabisaa mmaako mmaako se, “Awurade, ɛyɛ me ana?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu buae se, <char style="wj">“Nea ɔne me nsa da asanka baako mu no, ɔno na obeyi me ama.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no rekɔ sɛnea wɔakyerɛw afa ne ho de, nanso onipa a obeyi no ama no, nnue! Sɛ wɔanwo saa onipa no mpo a, anka eye.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yuda a obeyi no ama nso bisaa no se, “Kyerɛkyerɛfo, ɛyɛ me ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu buaa no se, <char style="wj">“Woaka.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidi Kronkron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Bere a wɔredidi no. Yesu faa brodo, na ohyiraa so bubuu mu, de maa nʼasuafo no kae se: <char style="wj">“Munnye nni, eyi ne me nipadua.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Na ɔfaa kuruwa no, na ɔdaa ase no, ɔde maa wɔn kae se, <char style="wj">“Mo nyinaa monnom bi,</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/><char style="wj">na eyi ne me mogya a ɛhyɛ Apam Foforo no mu den, a wohwie gu ma nnipa bebree nya bɔnefakyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/><char style="wj">Mise mo sɛ, merennom saa nsa yi bi bio da, de bɛkɔ akosi da a me ne mo bɛnom bi bio wɔ mʼAgya Ahenni no mu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Na wɔtoo dwom wiee no, wofii adi kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔw no so.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Petro Pa A Ɔbɛpa No No Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Anadwo yi, mo nyinaa beguan agya me. Na wɔakyerɛw se,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘wɔbɛbɔ oguanhwɛfo no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="wj">na nguankuw no abɔ apete.’</char><verse eid="MAT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>
    <char style="wj">Na sɛ miwu sɔre a, medi mo kan akɔ Galilea.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petro buae se, “Sɛ nnipa nyinaa beguan agya wo a, me de, merenguan nnya wo da.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu buae se, <char style="wj">“Nokware mise wo sɛ, ansa na akokɔ bɛbɔn no, na woapa me mprɛnsa!”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petro pae mu kae se, “Mpo sɛ etwa sɛ me ne wo wu a, merempa wo da!” Asuafo no nyinaa nso kaa saa asɛm koro yi ara.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Bɔ Mpae Wɔ Getsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Yesu de wɔn kɔɔ baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ Getsemane. Woduu hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Montena ha na merekɔ hɔ akɔbɔ mpae.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Ɔfaa Petro ne Sebedeo mma baanu no kaa ne ho, na ne werɛ fii ase howee, na ne ho nso yeraw no. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Awerɛhow ahyɛ me kra so de kɔ owu mu. Montena ha na mo ne me nwɛn.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Na ɔkɔɔ nʼanim kakra, de nʼanim kobutuw fam bɔɔ mpae se, <char style="wj">“MʼAgya, sɛ ebetumi a, ma wonyi kuruwa yi mfi me so. Nanso nea wopɛ na ɛnyɛ na ɛnyɛ nea mepɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Na ɔsan baa asuafo baasa no nkyɛn behuu sɛ wɔadeda. Ɔfrɛɛ Petro bisaa no se, <char style="wj">“Petro, woantumi antena ase ne me anwɛn dɔnhwerew baako pɛ mpo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/><char style="wj">Monwɛn na mommɔ mpae, na moankɔ sɔhwɛ mu. Honhom no pɛ de, nanso ɔhonam no yɛ mmerɛw!”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Ɔsan gyaw wɔn hɔ nea ɛto so abien kɔbɔɔ mpae se, <char style="wj">“MʼAgya, sɛ wɔrenyi kuruwa yi mfi me so, na nom ara na ɛsɛ sɛ menom a, nea wopɛ nyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Ɔsan baa wɔn nkyɛn bio behuu wɔn sɛ wɔadeda efisɛ na wɔn ani kum yiye. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Ɔsan kɔɔ mpaebɔ a ɛto so abiɛsa so kɔbɔɔ mpae kaa asɛm koro no ara.<verse eid="MAT 26:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Ɔsan baa asuafo no nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Afei de, monna na monhome. Nanso dɔn no adu. Wɔrebeyi Onipa Ba no ahyɛ nnebɔneyɛfo nsa!</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/><char style="wj">Monsɔre na yɛnkɔ! Monhwɛ! Nea ɔreyi me ama no na ɔreba no!”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Ogu so rekasa no, Yuda a ɔyɛ asuafo dumien no mu baako ne dɔm a Yudafo mpanyin asoma wɔn a wokurakura afoa ne nkontimmaa baa hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Na Yuda aka akyerɛ wɔn se, “Nea mefew nʼafono no ne onipa no; mokyere no” <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Yuda baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbam no kae se, “Me wura!” Na ofew nʼafono.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Damfo, nea wobaa ha se worebɛyɛ no, yɛ no ntɛm.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Ɛhɔ ara, wɔn a wɔne Yuda nam no kyeree Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Wɔn a wɔka Yesu ho no mu baako twee nʼafoa de twaa Ɔsɔfopanyin no akoa bi aso.<verse eid="MAT 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Fa wʼafoa no to nea ɛda. Na wɔn a wɔtwe afoa no, afoa ano na wobewu. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/><char style="wj">Munnim sɛ metumi aka akyerɛ mʼAgya na wasoma nʼabɔfo mpempem aba ntɛm so, na wɔabɛbɔ yɛn ho ban?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/><char style="wj">Nanso sɛ meyɛ saa a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na nea Kyerɛwsɛm no ka se ɛsɛ sɛ esi wɔ eyi ho no bɛba mu?”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Bere no mu ara na Yesu bisaa dɔm a wɔbaa ne so no se, <char style="wj">“Midi atuatewfo anim nti na mode afoa ne nkontimmaa aba me so sɛ mode rebɛkyere me yi? Metenaa mo nkyɛn kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ hyiadan mu da biara, nso moansiw me kwan.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/><char style="wj">Nanso eyi nyinaa aba sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a nea adiyifo no kae wɔ Kyerɛwsɛm mu no bɛba mu.”</char> Saa bere no ara mu na asuafo no nyinaa guan gyaa no.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Kaiafa Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Afei dɔm a wɔkyeree Yesu no de no kɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanyin Kaiafa anim, baabi a mmarakyerɛfo ne Yudafo mpanyin nyinaa ahyia hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Petro tew ne ho dii nnipadɔm no akyi baa Ɔsɔfopanyin no fi hɔ bi. Ɔkɔtenaa asomfo a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu se ɔrehwɛ asɛm a ebesi.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo asennifo akunini nyinaa hyiaa wɔ hɔ hwehwɛɛ sɛ wobenya nnansefo bi a wobedi adansekurum ato Yesu so, na wɔagyina so abu no kumfɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Nnipa bebree bedii adanse, nanso wohuu sɛ wɔredi adansekurumu, efisɛ na wɔn nsɛm a wɔka no nyinaa bɔ abira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">Akyiri no, nnipa baanu bi ba bɛkae <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>se, “Saa onipa yi kae se, ‘Metumi abubu Onyankopɔn asɔredan na masi no nnansa!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Ɔsɔfopanyin no sɔre bisaa Yesu se, “Dɛn na wowɔ ka? Wokaa saa anaasɛ woanka saa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Nanso Yesu ammua no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">Ɔsɔfopanyin no ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Meka Onyankopɔn teasefo no sɛ, sɛ wone Agyenkwa no, Onyankopɔn Ba no a, ka kyerɛ yɛn!”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Yiw, woaka. Na mereka kyerɛ mo nyinaa: Efi nnɛ mubehu Onipa Ba no sɛ mete Onyankopɔn nifa na ɔnam omununkum mu resan aba.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Ɔsɔfopanyin no sunsuan nʼatade mu teɛɛ mu se, “Abususɛm! Nnansefo bɛn na wɔn ho hia yɛn bio? Mo nyinaa ate abususɛm a ɔkae no! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Asɛm bɛn na mowɔ ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Wɔn nyinaa teɛɛ mu se, “Ɔsɛ owu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Afei wɔtee ntasu guu nʼani so. Ebinom bobɔɔ no akuturuku na ebinom nso bobɔɔ no asotɔre <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>kae se, “Wone Agyenkwa no! Kyerɛ yɛn nea ɔbɔɔ wo?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Saa bere no na Petro te adiwo. Abaawa bi baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Wo nso, na wo ne Yesu na ɛnam. Mo nyinaa mufi Galilea.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Nanso Petro san se, “Minnim nea woreka yi ho hwee.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Akyiri no, abaawa foforo bi hyiaa no wɔ ɔpon bi ano ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a ɔne wɔn gyina hɔ no se, “Na saa ɔbarima yi ne Yesu Nasareni no na ɛnam.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Petro de ntam san bio se, “Minnim saa onipa a moreka ne ho asɛm no.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Ɛkyɛe kakra no, mmarima a wogyina hɔ no bi bɛka kyerɛɛ Petro se, “Yenim sɛ woyɛ nʼasuafo no mu baako, na wo kasa nso da wo adi sɛ woyɛ Galileani.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Petro fii ase dii nsew, kekaa ntam se, “Minnim onipa no!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Amono mu hɔ ara na akokɔ bɔnee. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Ɛhɔ na Petro kaee asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no se, <char style="wj">“Akokɔ remmɔn na woapa me mprɛnsa”</char> no. Na ofii adi kosui.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Sɛn Ne Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Ade kyee no, asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin kɔɔ agyina, hwehwɛɛ ɔkwan a wɔbɛfa so ama wɔakum Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Afei wɔde nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn guu Yesu, de no baa Pilato a ɔyɛ Roma amrado no anim.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ahonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Saa bere no ara mu na Yuda a oyii Yesu mae no huu sɛ wɔabu Yesu kumfɔ no, onuu ne ho yiye. Enti ɔsan de sika a ogye fii asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin no nkyɛn no brɛɛ wɔn kae se, <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>“Mayɛ bɔne, efisɛ mayi onipa a ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara no ama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Wɔn nso kae se, “Ɛmfa yɛn ho. Ɛyɛ wo ara wʼasɛm.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Ɔtow sika no guu asɔredan no mu, fii hɔ kɔsɛn ne ho.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Asɔfo mpanyin no sesaw sika no kae se, “Yɛrentumi mfa saa sika yi mfra yɛn tow a yɛagye mu. Efisɛ yɛn mmara mma ho kwan sɛ yebegye sika a wɔde abɔ awudi ho paa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Wodwinnwen ho sii gyinae se, wɔde sika no bɛtɔ asase bi a wotu dɔte wɔ mu de nwen nkuku, na wɔde ɛhɔ ayɛ amusiei ama ahɔho a wobewu wɔ Yerusalem no. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Enti na wɔda so frɛ saa asase no se, “Mogya Asase” de besi nnɛ yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Eyi maa nea Odiyifo Yeremia kae se, “Wogyee dwetɛ mpɔw aduasa, bo a Israelfo sese huu sɛ ɛfata, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>na wofii mu tɔɔ asase fii anwemfo nkyɛn, sɛnea Awurade hyɛɛ me” no baa mu.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Afei wɔde Yesu begyinaa Pilato a ɔyɛ Roma amrado no anim. Obisaa Yesu se, “Wone Yudafo Hene no ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu buae se, <char style="wj">“Wo na woaka.”</char><verse eid="MAT 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Nanso bere a asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin reka nsɛm gu Yesu so no, wankasa. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Pilato bisaa no se, “Wonte nea wɔreka no ana?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Nanso Yesu anka hwee ma ɛyɛɛ amrado no nwonwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wobu Yesu Kumfɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Na ɛyɛ amrado no amanne sɛ afe biara Twam Afahyɛ mu no, ogyaa odeduani baako a ɔman no pɛ sɛ wogyaa no. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Saa afe no mu, na onipa bɔnefo bi a wɔfrɛ no Baraba nso da afiase. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Anɔpa no a nnipadɔm no hyiaa wɔ Pilato ahemfi anim hɔ no, Pilato bisaa wɔn se, “Hena na mopɛ sɛ migyaa no ma mo, Baraba anaa Yesu, mo Agyenkwa no?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Na onim pefee sɛ Yudafo mpanyin no de ɔtan na akyere Yesu efisɛ na wagye din.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilato gu so redi Yesu asɛm no, ne yere soma ma wɔbɛka kyerɛɛ no se, “Gyaa onipa trenee no na ɔnkɔ ne baabi efisɛ anadwo yi, mesoo ne ho dae a ɛyɛ hu yiye maa me ho yeraw me.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Nanso asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin kasa kyerɛɛ dɔm no se, wommisa na wonnyaa Baraba mma wɔn na wonkum Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Enti amrado no san bisaa wɔn se, “Nnipa baanu yi mu hena na mopɛ sɛ migyaa no ma mo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Na dɔm no bɔ gyee so se, “Baraba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilato bisaa wɔn bio se, “Sɛ saa de a, ɛno de, dɛn na menyɛ Yesu, mo Agyenkwa no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wɔn nyinaa bɔ gyee so bio se, “Bɔ no asennua mu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilato bisaa wɔn se, “Adɛn nti? Bɔne bɛn na wayɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Nanso wɔkɔɔ so bɔ gyee so ara se, “Bɔ no asennua mu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Pilato huu sɛ ɔyɛ asɛm no ho hwee a ɛnyɛ ye na basabasayɛ reba no, ɔma wɔsaw nsu guu ade mu brɛɛ no ma ɔhohoroo ne nsa wɔ dɔm no anim kae se, “Minni saa onipa trenee yi mogya ho fɔ. Nea ɛbɛba biara no yɛ mo asɛm!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Nnipadɔm no san bɔ gyee so bio se, “Ne mogya mmegu yɛn ne yɛn mma ti so.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Afei Pilato yii Baraba fii afiase hɔ de no maa wɔn. Ɔbɔɔ Yesu mmaa, na ɔde no maa Roma asraafo no sɛ wɔmfa no nkɔbɔ no asennua mu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Fɛwdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Asraafo no de Yesu kɔɔ amrado aban mu hɔ, na wɔfrɛɛ asraafo dɔm baa hɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Woyii Yesu atade a na ɛhyɛ no no de batakari kɔkɔɔ bi hyɛɛ no, <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>na wɔde nsɔe atenten nwenee kyɛw hyɛɛ no, na wɔde dua bi hyɛɛ ne nsa nifa sɛ ahempema, na wobubuu nkotodwe wɔ nʼanim fii ase bɔ gyee so, dii ne ho fɛw se, “Yudafo Hene, wo nkwa so.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Wɔtetee ntasu guu ne so na wogyee dua no fii ne nsam de paa nʼapampam ntoatoaso. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Wodii ne ho fɛw wiei no, wɔworɔw batakari kɔkɔɔ a wɔde hyɛɛ no no, de nʼankasa atade no san hyɛɛ no. Afei wɔde no kɔɔ sɛ wɔrekɔbɔ no asennua mu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Yesu Asennua Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Bere a wɔde no rekɔ faako a wɔbɔ asennua mu hɔ no, wohyiaa ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon a ofi Kirene a ɛwɔ Abibirim. Wɔhyɛɛ no ma ɔsoaa Yesu asennua no bi. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Wɔde Yesu kɔɔ baabi a wɔfrɛ hɔ Golgota a ne nkyerɛase ne “Nitiri So.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Ɛhɔ na asraafo no maa no nsa nwenweenwen bi sɛ ɔnnom. Yesu kaa nʼano no, wannom. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Afei wɔbɔɔ no asennua mu no, wɔbɔɔ nʼatade no so ntonto kyekyɛ fae. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Wɔn nyinaa tenatenaa ase wɛn no. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Wɔkyerɛw nsɛm a wɔka guu ne so no bi fam nʼatifi se,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">“YESU, YUDAFO HENE NO NI.”<verse eid="MAT 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Wɔbɔɔ awudifo baanu bi asennua mu kaa Yesu ho. Na ɔbaako sɛn ne nifa so na ɔbaako nso dɛn ne benkum so. <verse eid="MAT 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Nnipa a wotwaa mu wɔ hɔ no nyinaa wosow wɔn ti, yeyaw no <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>se, “Wo na wuse sɛ wubetumi abubu asɔredan na wode nnansa asi no, gye wo ho! Sɛ woyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba ampa ara a, ɛno de sian fi asennua no so si fam ma yɛnhwɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Saa ara nso na asɔfo mpanyin ne Yudafo mpanyin bedii ne ho fɛw se, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Ogye afoforo, nanso ontumi nnye ne ho! Sɛ wone Israelfo hene no ampa ara a, sian fi asennua no so si fam, na yennye wo nni. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Ɔde ne ho too Onyankopɔn so. Afei ma Onyankopɔn nnye no! Waka nso se, ‘Meyɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Awudifo bi a wɔbɔɔ wɔne no asennua mu no nso yeyaw no saa ara.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Bere a wɔbɔɔ Yesu asennua mu no, sum duruu asase so mmaa nyinaa fi owigyinae kɔpem nnɔnabiɛsa. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Ɛbɛyɛ nnɔnabiɛsa bere mu no, Yesu teɛɛ mu dennen se, <char style="wj">“Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?” Ase kyerɛ sɛ, “Me Nyankopɔn, me Nyankopɔn, adɛn nti na woagyaw me?”</char><verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Wɔn a wogyina hɔ no bi tee no wɔkae se, “Ɔrefrɛ Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 27:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Mpofirim, wɔn mu baako tuu mmirika kɔfaa sapɔw bi de bɔɔ nsa nwenweenwen bi mu de tuaa dua bi so de brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnnom. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Nanso nnipa no nkae no kae se, “Gyaa no na yɛnhwɛ sɛ Elia bɛba abegye no ana.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Na Yesu teɛɛ mu dennen bio no, ogyaa ne honhom mu wui.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Ɛhɔ ara, ntama a etwa asɔredan no mu no mu suanee abien fi soro kosii fam. Asase wosowee. Abotan paapaee. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Nna so buebue maa atreneefo a wɔawuwu nyannyanee. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Yesu wusɔre akyi no, wopuepue fii wɔn nna mu kɔɔ Yerusalem, koyii wɔn ho adi kyerɛɛ nnipa bebree.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Asraafo a wɔwɔ hɔ no huu asase wosow ne nsɛm a esisii wɔ hɔ no, wɔn koma tuu yiye ma wɔkae se, “Ampa ara, onipa yi yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Saa bere no na mmea bebree a Yesu ho dɔ nti, wodii nʼakyi fii Galilea no gyinagyina akyiri baabi rehwɛ nea ɛrekɔ so. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Mmea no bi ne Maria Magdalene ne Maria a ɔyɛ Yakobo ne Yosef na. Na Sebedeo mmabarima no na nso ka ho.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wosie Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Eduu anwummere no, osikani bi a wɔfrɛ no Yosef a ofi Arimatea a na ɔyɛ Yesu suani no, <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>kɔɔ Pilato hɔ kɔsrɛ ma wɔde Yesu amu no maa no. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yosef faa amu no de nwera kyekyeree ho, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>na ɔde no kɔtoo ɔno ankasa ne boda foforo bi a watwa mu, pirew ɔbo kɛse bi hinii ano, ansa na ɔregyaw hɔ akɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Maria Magdalene ne Maria baako no de, na wɔte nkyɛn baabi rewɛn ɔboda no.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔwɛn Ɔboda No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Ade kyee a ɛyɛ da a edi Twam Afahyɛ no ahosiesie akyi no, asɔfo mpanyin ne Farisifo no kɔɔ Pilato nkyɛn, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Owura, ɔtorofo no kaa bere bi se, ‘Nnansa akyi no mɛsɔre.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Eyi nti ma yɛn kwan na yɛnkɔwɛn da no ano nkosi nnansa, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a nʼasuafo no ntwa wɔn ho nkowia amu no mmɔ no dawuru se wasɔre afi awufo mu. Na sɛ ɛkɔba saa de a anka akyiri no nnaadaa bɛsen kan de no.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilato ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Momfa awɛmfo. Momma wɔnkɔwɛn.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Enti wɔkɔtetaree ɔboda no ano, maa awɛmfo kɔwɛn hɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asɔre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Homeda no akyi Memeneda ahemadakye, Maria Magdalene ne Maria baako no kɔɔ ɔda no so.<verse eid="MAT 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Asase wosow denneennen, na Awurade bɔfo sian fii ɔsoro ba bepirew ɔbo no fii ɔda no ano, na ɔtenaa so. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Nʼanim hyerɛn te sɛ kanea na nʼatade yɛ fitaa te sɛ nwera. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Awɛmfo no huu no no, ehu maa wɔn ho popoe, na wɔhwehwee ase, dan sɛ awufo.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Ɔbɔfo no ka kyerɛɛ mmea no se, “Munnsuro! Minim sɛ morehwehwɛ Yesu a wɔbɔɔ no asennua mu no, <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>nanso onni ha. Wasɔre kɔ sɛnea ɔkae no. Mommra mmɛhwɛ nea na ɔda hɔ no. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Afei monkɔ ntɛm nkɔka nkyerɛ nʼasuafo no se, ‘Wasɔre afi awufo mu, na ɔredi mo anim kan akɔ Galilea akohyia mo wɔ hɔ.’ Eyi ne nkra a mewɔ de ma mo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Mmea no de ehu ne anigye a adi afra tutuu mmirika fii ɔda no so sɛ, wɔrekɔhwehwɛ asuafo no aka ɔbɔfo no nkra no akyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Wɔrekɔ no, prɛko pɛ, Yesu begyinaa wɔn anim. Okyiaa wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Asomdwoe nka mo.”</char> Wobuu no nkotodwe, som no. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Afei Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, <char style="wj">“Munnsuro! Monkɔ nkɔka nkyerɛ me nuanom no se wɔnkɔ Galilea nkohyia me wɔ hɔ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nea Awɛmfo No Kae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Bere a mmea no rekɔ kurow no mu no, awɛmfo a wɔwɛn ɔda no mu bi kɔɔ asɔfo mpanyin no nkyɛn kɔkaa nea asi no nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Yudafo mpanyin no nyinaa hyiae, na wosii no gyinae se, wɔbɛma awɛmfo no sika aka akyerɛ wɔn <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>se, “Monka se, ‘Anadwo a yɛdae no na nʼasuafo no ba bewiaa amu no kɔe.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Wɔhyɛɛ awɛmfo no bɔ se, “Sɛ ɛba sɛ amrado te ɛho asɛm a, yebedi mo adanse sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔrenyɛ mo hwee.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Eyi nti awɛmfo no gyee sika no kɔyɛɛ sɛnea wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no. Asɛm a wɔkae no trɛw faa Yudafo no mu nyinaa na wogye dii de besi nnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsoma Kɛse No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Afei asuafo dubaako no sii mu kɔɔ Galilea bepɔw a Yesu kae se wɔnkɔ so no so. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Ɛhɔ na wohuu no, kotow, sɔree no. Nanso na wɔn mu bi nnye nni ara. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafo no se, <char style="wj">“Wɔde ɔsoro ne asase so tumi nyinaa ama me.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/><char style="wj">Enti monkɔ nkɔyɛ amanaman nyinaa mʼasuafo. Mommɔ wɔn asu nhyɛ Agya, Ɔba ne Honhom Kronkron din mu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/><char style="wj">na monkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, wonni nea mahyɛ mo no nyinaa so. Na me ne mo wɔ hɔ nna nyinaa de bɛkɔ akosi wiase awiei.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
